#: manual/api/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common.md:1
msgid "dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common API"
msgstr "dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common API"

#: manual/api/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common.md:3
msgid "`Luna-Flow/diff_bench/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common` is an executable package. It has no public items; its interface is the command line and the files it writes. It uses the library package [`dzmingli_vs_floating`](../dzmingli_vs_floating.md)."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/diff_bench/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common` 是一个可执行包。它没有公开项；它的接口就是命令行和它写出的文件。它使用库包 [`dzmingli_vs_floating`](../dzmingli_vs_floating.md)。"

#: manual/api/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common.md:19
msgid "It runs `run_mare_benchmark` twice with `default_benchmark_protocol()` and seed `0xDEC1A1`: all 19 measured operations at 1, 4, 8, 16, 18 and 28 coefficient digits, three datasets per size, once per timing scope (`arithmetic_only` and `full_path`)."
msgstr "它以 `default_benchmark_protocol()` 和种子 `0xDEC1A1` 运行两次 `run_mare_benchmark`：在 1、4、8、16、18 和 28 位系数上运行全部 19 种被测运算，每个规模三个数据集，每个计时范围（`arithmetic_only` 与 `full_path`）各一次。"

#: manual/api/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common.md:29
msgid "`artifacts/dzmingli_vs_floating/common_digits.html`: a self-contained HTML report written with `mare_performance_report_html`. The directories are created when missing."
msgstr "`artifacts/dzmingli_vs_floating/common_digits.html`：用 `mare_performance_report_html` 写出的自包含 HTML 报告。目录不存在时会被创建。"

#: manual/api/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common.md:34
#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common.md:32
msgid "The executable aborts with `common-digits decimal differential validation failed` when any validation failed, after the report has been written. A complete run without failures exits normally."
msgstr "只要有任何校验失败，程序就在写完报告后以 `common-digits decimal differential validation failed` 中止。没有失败的完整运行正常退出。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:1
msgid "floating_vs_decmial_x API"
msgstr "floating_vs_decmial_x API"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:3
msgid "The package `Luna-Flow/diff_bench/floating_vs_decmial_x` compares `moonbitlang/x/decimal` (X) with `Luna-Flow/floating/decimal_gda@0.7.1` (GDA) on identical decimal inputs, checks both against a `BigInt` oracle, and measures them with Mare Mark. It is a benchmark harness kept in the GitHub repository for reproduction; it is not a runtime dependency for other projects. Functions abort on input outside their contract."
msgstr "包 `Luna-Flow/diff_bench/floating_vs_decmial_x` 在相同的十进制输入上比较 `moonbitlang/x/decimal`（X）与 `Luna-Flow/floating/decimal_gda@0.7.1`（GDA），用 `BigInt` 预言机检验两者，并用 Mare Mark 测量。它是保存在 GitHub 仓库中用于复现的基准框架，不是其他项目的运行时依赖。函数在输入超出约定时中止。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:10
msgid "The package name keeps the historical spelling `decmial`. The [tutorial](../tutorial/floating_vs_decmial_x.md) shows the items in use, and the [design page](../design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md) derives the precision contracts. Source: `src/floating_vs_decmial_x/`."
msgstr "包名保留了历史拼写 `decmial`。[教程](../tutorial/floating_vs_decmial_x.md)演示条目的用法，[设计页](../design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md)推导精度约定。源码：`src/floating_vs_decmial_x/`。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:15
msgid "Examples import the package as `@floating_vs_decmial_x` and `moonbitlang/core/bigint`."
msgstr "示例以 `@floating_vs_decmial_x` 和 `moonbitlang/core/bigint` 的形式导入。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:20
msgid "These items have the same definitions as in [`dzmingli_vs_floating`](dzmingli_vs_floating.md#neutral-decimal-model); the two packages keep separate copies so that each benchmark builds alone."
msgstr "这些条目与 [`dzmingli_vs_floating`](dzmingli_vs_floating.md#neutral-decimal-model) 中的定义相同；两个包各自保留一份副本，使每个基准都能独立构建。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:26
msgid "`DecimalValue` is the implementation-neutral decimal $(c, s)$ with value $c \\cdot 10^{-s}$."
msgstr "`DecimalValue` 是与实现无关的十进制数 $(c, s)$，其值为 $c \\cdot 10^{-s}$。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:38
msgid "`normalize` removes trailing zeros from the coefficient while the scale stays non-negative; zero becomes $(0, 0)$."
msgstr "`normalize` 在标度保持非负的前提下去掉系数末尾的零；零变为 $(0, 0)$。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:47
msgid "`canonical_string` renders the normalized value in positional notation without an exponent; equal numbers give equal strings."
msgstr "`canonical_string` 以不带指数的位置记数法输出规范化后的值；相等的数给出相等的字符串。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:56
msgid "`parse_decimal_value` reads a finite decimal string, with optional sign, point and exponent, into a normalized value. It aborts on anything else."
msgstr "`parse_decimal_value` 把带可选符号、小数点和指数的有限十进制字符串读入为规范化的值。遇到其他内容时中止。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:113
msgid "`multiply` returns the exact product."
msgstr "`multiply` 返回精确积。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:121
msgid "`compare` returns `-1`, `0` or `1`."
msgstr "`compare` 返回 `-1`、`0` 或 `1`。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:141
msgid "The oracle models X's result policy: at most 28 fractional digits, extra digits truncated toward zero."
msgstr "预言机模拟 X 的结果策略：至多 28 位小数，多出的位向零截断。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:146
msgid "`oracle_multiply` returns the exact product, truncated toward zero to 28 fractional digits when its scale exceeds 28."
msgstr "`oracle_multiply` 返回精确积；当其标度超过 28 时向零截断到 28 位小数。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:155
msgid "`oracle_divide` returns the quotient truncated toward zero to 28 fractional digits, computed with integer division only."
msgstr "`oracle_divide` 返回向零截断到 28 位小数的商，只用整数除法计算。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:162
msgid "With $k = 28 + s_r - s_\\ell$ the result coefficient is $\\operatorname{trunc}(c_\\ell \\cdot 10^{k} / c_r)$ when $k \\ge 0$ and $\\operatorname{trunc}(\\operatorname{trunc}(c_\\ell / 10^{-k}) / c_r)$ otherwise, at scale 28. Aborts on a zero divisor. Repeating quotients are fine here, unlike in `dzmingli_vs_floating`."
msgstr "记 $k = 28 + s_r - s_\\ell$，当 $k \\ge 0$ 时结果系数为 $\\operatorname{trunc}(c_\\ell \\cdot 10^{k} / c_r)$，否则为 $\\operatorname{trunc}(\\operatorname{trunc}(c_\\ell / 10^{-k}) / c_r)$，标度为 28。除数为零时中止。与 `dzmingli_vs_floating` 不同，这里循环小数的商没有问题。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:170
msgid "`oracle_operation` evaluates an `Operation` with the rules above: exact `Add`, `Subtract` and `Compare`, the truncating `Multiply` and `Divide`, and the identity for `Parse` and `Format`."
msgstr "`oracle_operation` 按上述规则计算 `Operation`：精确的 `Add`、`Subtract` 和 `Compare`，截断的 `Multiply` 和 `Divide`，以及 `Parse` 和 `Format` 的恒等映射。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:178
msgid "The oracle does not depend on `DecimalSemantics`; the [design page](../design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md#one-oracle-for-both-groups) shows why one oracle serves both groups."
msgstr "预言机不依赖 `DecimalSemantics`；[设计页](../design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md#one-oracle-for-both-groups)说明了为什么一个预言机能同时服务两个组。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:199
msgid "Operations, semantics and suites"
msgstr "运算、语义与套件"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:203
msgid "`Operation` lists the operation families of this benchmark."
msgstr "`Operation` 列出本基准的运算族。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:217
msgid "`Parse` and `Format` return the prepared left operand on both sides and are not run by the executables."
msgstr "`Parse` 与 `Format` 在两边都返回预先准备好的左操作数，可执行程序不运行它们。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:222
msgid "`operation_name` returns the snake-case name used in records, such as `\"divide\"`."
msgstr "`operation_name` 返回记录中使用的蛇形命名，例如 `\"divide\"`。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:231
msgid "`DecimalSemantics` selects the semantic contract both implementations must meet."
msgstr "`DecimalSemantics` 选择两个实现都必须满足的语义约定。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:241
msgid "`ExactOverlap` uses inputs whose exact result both libraries represent, so no rounding happens on either side. `XCompatible` reproduces X's 28-fractional-digit truncation in GDA by a `quantize` after `multiply` and `divide`, inside the timed path."
msgstr "`ExactOverlap` 使用两个库都能表示其精确结果的输入，因此两边都不发生舍入。`XCompatible` 在 GDA 中通过在 `multiply` 和 `divide` 之后执行一次 `quantize` 来重现 X 的 28 位小数截断，该步骤位于计时路径之内。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:248
msgid "`decimal_semantics_name` returns `\"exact_overlap\"` or `\"x_compatible\"`."
msgstr "`decimal_semantics_name` 返回 `\"exact_overlap\"` 或 `\"x_compatible\"`。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:256
msgid "`OperandShape` labels a generated case; the label does not influence the operands."
msgstr "`OperandShape` 为生成的用例打标签；该标签不影响操作数。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:271
msgid "`TimingScope` names what a timed invocation contains, for suite metadata."
msgstr "`TimingScope` 为套件元数据命名一次计时调用所包含的内容。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:280
msgid "The Mare Mark runner does not read it. Comparison records carry a string scope instead: `\"semantic_equivalent_pipeline\"` for `Multiply` and `Divide` under `XCompatible`, `\"arithmetic_only\"` otherwise."
msgstr "Mare Mark 运行器不读取它。比较记录改为携带字符串形式的范围：`XCompatible` 下的 `Multiply` 与 `Divide` 为 `\"semantic_equivalent_pipeline\"`，其余为 `\"arithmetic_only\"`。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:301
msgid "`default_suite` returns the suite `\"decimal-x-floating-gda\"` with all seven operations, scales `[0, 2, 6, 18, 28]`, `OperationOnly`, 5 warmups and 20 samples."
msgstr "`default_suite` 返回套件 `\"decimal-x-floating-gda\"`：全部七种运算、标度 `[0, 2, 6, 18, 28]`、`OperationOnly`、5 次预热和 20 个样本。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:330
msgid "`generate_decimal(seed, digits, scale, negative)` builds a decimal string with exactly `digits` coefficient digits in $1..9$, `scale` of them fractional. Aborts if `digits <= 0` or `scale < 0`."
msgstr "`generate_decimal(seed, digits, scale, negative)` 构造一个系数恰有 `digits` 位（每位在 $1..9$ 中）的十进制字符串，其中 `scale` 位是小数。若 `digits <= 0` 或 `scale < 0` 则中止。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:356
msgid "`generate_cases(seed, count, operation)` returns `count` reproducible cases with $1..24$ digits and scales $0..8$, without clock or global random state."
msgstr "`generate_cases(seed, count, operation)` 返回 `count` 个可复现的用例，位数为 $1..24$、标度为 $0..8$，不使用时钟或全局随机状态。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:365
msgid "`serialize_case` joins `decimal-neutral-v1` and the case fields with newlines."
msgstr "`serialize_case` 用换行连接 `decimal-neutral-v1` 与用例各字段。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:373
msgid "`fingerprint_case` hashes `serialize_case` with Mare Mark's `stable_fingerprint`."
msgstr "`fingerprint_case` 用 Mare Mark 的 `stable_fingerprint` 对 `serialize_case` 求哈希。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:382
msgid "`expand_digit_scales(sizes, n)` repeats each coefficient size `n` times, one Mare Mark dataset per repetition."
msgstr "`expand_digit_scales(sizes, n)` 把每个系数规模重复 `n` 次，每次重复对应一个 Mare Mark 数据集。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:403
msgid "`working_precision(operation, left, right, semantics?)` returns the GDA context precision of a fixture. `semantics` defaults to `XCompatible`."
msgstr "`working_precision(operation, left, right, semantics?)` 返回夹具的 GDA 上下文精度。`semantics` 默认为 `XCompatible`。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:410
msgid "With $d_\\ell, d_r$ the coefficient digit counts and $s_\\ell, s_r$ the scales:"
msgstr "记 $d_\\ell, d_r$ 为系数位数，$s_\\ell, s_r$ 为标度："

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:412
msgid "Precision"
msgstr "精度"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:420
msgid "The [design page](../design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md#precision-contracts) derives each line and the operand classes it covers."
msgstr "[设计页](../design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md#precision-contracts)推导了每一行及其覆盖的操作数类别。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:425
msgid "`DecimalFixture` holds both implementations' operands, built before timing."
msgstr "`DecimalFixture` 保存两个实现在计时前构造好的操作数。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:442
msgid "`@decimal` is `moonbitlang/x/decimal`. `gda_quantum_28` is $10^{-28}$, the quantum of the `XCompatible` post-processing."
msgstr "`@decimal` 指 `moonbitlang/x/decimal`。`gda_quantum_28` 为 $10^{-28}$，即 `XCompatible` 后处理所用的量子。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:447
msgid "`prepare_fixture(operation, left, right, semantics?)` computes the precision $p$, converts both operands for X and for GDA, and builds a GDA context with precision $p$ and rounding toward zero."
msgstr "`prepare_fixture(operation, left, right, semantics?)` 计算精度 $p$，为 X 和 GDA 分别转换两个操作数，并构造精度为 $p$、向零舍入的 GDA 上下文。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:455
msgid "`semantics` defaults to `XCompatible`. The GDA operands are parsed with precision $p$ and half-even rounding, so an operand with more than $p$ significant digits is rounded; see the [known limitation](../design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md#known-limitation-operand-rounding-in-x-compatible-division)."
msgstr "`semantics` 默认为 `XCompatible`。GDA 操作数以精度 $p$ 和半偶舍入解析，因此有效位数超过 $p$ 的操作数会被舍入；参见[已知限制](../design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md#known-limitation-operand-rounding-in-x-compatible-division)。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:462
msgid "`x_from_neutral` converts a value with `Decimal::new`; it aborts when the scale is outside X's range $0..28$."
msgstr "`x_from_neutral` 用 `Decimal::new` 转换值；当标度超出 X 的范围 $0..28$ 时中止。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:471
msgid "`gda_from_neutral(value, precision)` parses the canonical string with `Decimal::from_string(precision~)`."
msgstr "`gda_from_neutral(value, precision)` 用 `Decimal::from_string(precision~)` 解析规范字符串。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:490
msgid "`XCompare` holds X's comparison result already reduced to `-1`, `0` or `1`."
msgstr "`XCompare` 保存已被归约为 `-1`、`0` 或 `1` 的 X 比较结果。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:494
msgid "`run_x` performs the fixture's operation with X's operators `+`, `-`, `*`, `/` or `Compare::compare`."
msgstr "`run_x` 用 X 的运算符 `+`、`-`、`*`、`/` 或 `Compare::compare` 执行夹具的运算。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:503
msgid "`run_gda` performs the fixture's operation with floating GDA; under `XCompatible` it also quantizes products whose scale exceeds 28 and every quotient to $10^{-28}$."
msgstr "`run_gda` 用 floating GDA 执行夹具的运算；在 `XCompatible` 下，它还把标度超过 28 的积以及所有商量化到 $10^{-28}$。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:513
msgid "`canonical_x` converts an X decimal to a normalized `DecimalValue` from its coefficient and scale."
msgstr "`canonical_x` 根据 X 十进制数的系数和标度把它转换为规范化的 `DecimalValue`。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:522
msgid "`canonical_observation` converts any observation to a normalized `DecimalValue`; GDA results go through `to_string` and `parse_decimal_value`."
msgstr "`canonical_observation` 把任意观测值转换为规范化的 `DecimalValue`；GDA 结果经由 `to_string` 和 `parse_decimal_value`。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:565
msgid "`PerformanceResult` summarizes one operation, semantic group and coefficient size from paired confirmatory samples."
msgstr "`PerformanceResult` 根据配对的确认性样本汇总一种运算、一个语义组和一个系数规模的结果。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:583
msgid "`x_speedup_vs_gda` is the GDA median divided by the X median (above $1$ means X is faster). `decision` is `\"gda_faster\"`, `\"x_faster\"`, `\"equivalent\"`, `\"invalid\"` or `\"unknown\"`. Unlike `dzmingli_vs_floating`, results are always paired; a validation failure shows up only in the report counts."
msgstr "`x_speedup_vs_gda` 是 GDA 中位数除以 X 中位数（大于 $1$ 表示 X 更快）。`decision` 为 `\"gda_faster\"`、`\"x_faster\"`、`\"equivalent\"`、`\"invalid\"` 或 `\"unknown\"`。与 `dzmingli_vs_floating` 不同，结果总是配对的；校验失败只体现在报告计数中。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:590
msgid "`PerformanceResult::to_json` renders a `\"comparison\"` JSONL record with artifact version `mmka_1`."
msgstr "`PerformanceResult::to_json` 输出一条制品版本为 `mmka_1` 的 `\"comparison\"` JSONL 记录。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:599
msgid "`MareBenchmarkReport` collects the results, raw JSONL and validation counts of a run; `validation_count` counts passed and failed validations."
msgstr "`MareBenchmarkReport` 汇集一次运行的结果、原始 JSONL 和校验计数；`validation_count` 同时统计通过和失败的校验。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:613
msgid "`smoke_protocol` returns the short test protocol: 2 warmups, 0.5 ms calibration batches and 3 confirmatory repetitions."
msgstr "`smoke_protocol` 返回简短的测试协议：2 次预热、0.5 ms 校准批次和 3 次确认性重复。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:622
msgid "`default_benchmark_protocol` returns the protocol of the published runs: 5 warmups, 5 ms calibration batches, balanced blocks with seed `0xDEC1A1`, outliers reported only, and 20 confirmatory repetitions."
msgstr "`default_benchmark_protocol` 返回已发布运行所用的协议：5 次预热、5 ms 校准批次、种子为 `0xDEC1A1` 的平衡分块、只报告离群值，以及 20 次确认性重复。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:632
msgid "`benchmark_environment` builds the environment snapshot from the `MARE_*` environment variables, with fixed defaults for missing ones."
msgstr "`benchmark_environment` 根据 `MARE_*` 环境变量构造环境快照，缺失的变量取固定默认值。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:641
msgid "`run_mare_benchmark(operations, semantics, digit_scales, protocol, seed)` runs one Mare Mark experiment per operation under one semantic group and returns the combined report."
msgstr "`run_mare_benchmark(operations, semantics, digit_scales, protocol, seed)` 在一个语义组下为每种运算运行一次 Mare Mark 实验，并返回合并后的报告。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:649
msgid "Each dataset is validated against the oracle before timing. The function does not abort on failures; callers check `failed_count`. It runs on the `native` and `js` targets."
msgstr "每个数据集在计时前都先与预言机核对。该函数不会因失败而中止；调用者应检查 `failed_count`。它在 `native` 和 `js` 目标上运行。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:671
msgid "`mare_performance_report_document(results, target, run_id)` builds a Plot IR document with one latency plot per operation and semantic group, and one X-versus-GDA speedup plot per group."
msgstr "`mare_performance_report_document(results, target, run_id)` 构建 Plot IR 文档：每种运算与语义组一张延迟图，每个组一张 X 对 GDA 的加速比图。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:679
msgid "The corpus summary is total `validation_count + failed_count`, passed `validation_count` and failed `failed_count`. Because `validation_count` already includes failures, the summary is only right when `failed_count` is zero; see the [design page](../design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md#boundaries)."
msgstr "语料汇总为：总数 `validation_count + failed_count`、通过 `validation_count`、失败 `failed_count`。由于 `validation_count` 已包含失败数，只有当 `failed_count` 为零时该汇总才正确；参见[设计页](../design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md#boundaries)。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench.md:1
msgid "floating_vs_decmial_x/bench API"
msgstr "floating_vs_decmial_x/bench API"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench.md:3
msgid "`Luna-Flow/diff_bench/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench` is an executable package. It has no public items; its interface is the command line and the files it writes. It uses the library package [`floating_vs_decmial_x`](../floating_vs_decmial_x.md)."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/diff_bench/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench` 是一个可执行包。它没有公开项；它的接口就是命令行和它写出的文件。它使用库包 [`floating_vs_decmial_x`](../floating_vs_decmial_x.md)。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench.md:19
msgid "It runs `run_mare_benchmark` twice with `default_benchmark_protocol()` and seed `0xDEC1A1`, three datasets per size at 1, 4, 16, 64, 256, 1,024 and 4,096 coefficient digits:"
msgstr "它以 `default_benchmark_protocol()` 和种子 `0xDEC1A1` 运行两次 `run_mare_benchmark`，在 1、4、16、64、256、1,024 和 4,096 位系数上，每个规模三个数据集："

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench.md:23
msgid "Semantic group"
msgstr "语义组"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench.md:23
msgid "Timing scope"
msgstr "计时范围"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench.md:25
msgid "exact"
msgstr "精确"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench.md:26
msgid "X-compatible"
msgstr "X 兼容"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench.md:26
msgid "multiply, divide"
msgstr "multiply、divide"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench.md:33
msgid "`artifacts/floating_vs_decmial_x/scaling.html`: a self-contained HTML report written with `mare_performance_report_html`. The directories are created when missing."
msgstr "`artifacts/floating_vs_decmial_x/scaling.html`：用 `mare_performance_report_html` 写出的自包含 HTML 报告。目录不存在时会被创建。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common.md:1
msgid "floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common API"
msgstr "floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common API"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common.md:3
msgid "`Luna-Flow/diff_bench/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common` is an executable package. It has no public items; its interface is the command line and the files it writes. It uses the library package [`floating_vs_decmial_x`](../floating_vs_decmial_x.md)."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/diff_bench/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common` 是一个可执行包。它没有公开项；它的接口就是命令行和它写出的文件。它使用库包 [`floating_vs_decmial_x`](../floating_vs_decmial_x.md)。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common.md:19
msgid "It runs the same two experiments as the [scaling executable](bench.md), at 1, 4, 8, 16, 18 and 28 coefficient digits, three datasets per size."
msgstr "它在 1、4、8、16、18 和 28 位系数上运行与[规模扩展可执行程序](bench.md)相同的两个实验，每个规模三个数据集。"

#: manual/api/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common.md:27
msgid "`artifacts/floating_vs_decmial_x/common_digits.html`: a self-contained HTML report written with `mare_performance_report_html`. The directories are created when missing."
msgstr "`artifacts/floating_vs_decmial_x/common_digits.html`：用 `mare_performance_report_html` 写出的自包含 HTML 报告。目录不存在时会被创建。"

#: manual/contributing.md:1
msgid "Contribution guidelines"
msgstr "贡献指南"

#: manual/contributing.md:3
msgid "Code style"
msgstr "代码风格"

#: manual/contributing.md:5
msgid "Format all MoonBit code with `just fmt`."
msgstr "使用 `just fmt` 格式化 MoonBit 代码。"

#: manual/contributing.md:6
msgid "Keep files organized by package boundary first, then by behavior."
msgstr "优先按包边界组织文件，再按具体行为拆分。"

#: manual/contributing.md:7
msgid "Keep comments short and technical. Explain contracts, invariants, or non-obvious implementation choices."
msgstr "注释保持简短、技术化，只解释契约、不变量或不明显的实现选择。"

#: manual/contributing.md:9
msgid "Naming conventions"
msgstr "命名约定"

#: manual/contributing.md:11
msgid "Bindings and functions: lowercase with underscores, such as `scaled_value`."
msgstr "绑定与函数：小写字母加下划线，例如 `scaled_value`。"

#: manual/contributing.md:12
msgid "Types and traits: PascalCase, such as `Solver`."
msgstr "类型与 trait：PascalCase，例如 `Solver`。"

#: manual/contributing.md:13
msgid "Files: lowercase with underscores, named after concrete behavior."
msgstr "文件：小写字母加下划线，并以具体行为命名。"

#: manual/contributing.md:14
msgid "Error codes, if introduced, should use uppercase with underscores and an `E_` prefix."
msgstr "如需引入错误码，应使用大写字母加下划线，并以 `E_` 为前缀。"

#: manual/contributing.md:16
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: manual/contributing.md:18
msgid "Add or update tests whenever behavior changes."
msgstr "行为变更时同步添加或更新测试。"

#: manual/contributing.md:19
msgid "Use package-local `*_test.mbt` or `*_wbtest.mbt` files as appropriate."
msgstr "根据访问需求使用包内 `*_test.mbt` 或 `*_wbtest.mbt`。"

#: manual/contributing.md:20
