#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench.md:3
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common.md:3
msgid "Design goal"
msgstr "设计目标"

#: manual/design/core.md:5
msgid "The root package keeps the layout of the Luna-Flow repository template: a package at the source root with one public function and one test, so that `moon check`, `moon test` and `moon info` have something to work on in every repository."
msgstr "根包保持 Luna-Flow 仓库模板的布局：源根目录下一个包，含一个公开函数和一个测试，使 `moon check`、`moon test` 和 `moon info` 在每个仓库中都有可处理的对象。"

#: manual/design/core.md:10
#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:79
#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench.md:9
#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common.md:9
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:76
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench.md:9
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common.md:9
msgid "Design decisions"
msgstr "设计决策"

#: manual/design/core.md:12
msgid "**Benchmarks are subpackages.** Each comparison lives in its own package with its own dependencies, so `floating_vs_decmial_x` builds without `DzmingLi/decimal` and the other way around, and each can be documented and run alone."
msgstr "**基准是子包。** 每项比较都位于自己的包中，拥有自己的依赖，因此 `floating_vs_decmial_x` 不需要 `DzmingLi/decimal` 即可构建，反之亦然，并且每个包都可以单独编写文档和运行。"

#: manual/design/core.md:16
msgid "**Nothing is shared through the root.** The neutral decimal model is copied into each benchmark package instead of being moved here. That keeps each package self-contained at the cost of duplicated code; the copies are byte-identical (`canonical.mbt`, `parse.mbt`, `generator.mbt`)."
msgstr "**不通过根包共享任何东西。** 中立的十进制模型被复制到每个基准包中，而不是移到这里。这样每个包都是自包含的，代价是代码重复；这些副本逐字节相同（`canonical.mbt`、`parse.mbt`、`generator.mbt`）。"

#: manual/design/core.md:21
#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:357
#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench.md:36
#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common.md:35
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:244
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench.md:34
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common.md:34
msgid "Boundaries"
msgstr "边界"

#: manual/design/core.md:23
msgid "The root package provides no benchmark functionality and no shared helpers."
msgstr "根包不提供任何基准功能，也不提供共享的辅助函数。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:1
msgid "dzmingli_vs_floating design"
msgstr "dzmingli_vs_floating 设计"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:5
msgid "The package answers two questions about `DzmingLi/decimal@0.2.2` and `Luna-Flow/floating/decimal_gda@0.7.1`: do they compute the same exact decimal results, and how fast do they compute them as coefficients grow to thousands of digits? Speed is only reported where both answers are right, so the design is built around a correctness check that cannot be fooled by the libraries agreeing with each other."
msgstr "本包回答关于 `DzmingLi/decimal@0.2.2` 和 `Luna-Flow/floating/decimal_gda@0.7.1` 的两个问题：它们算出的精确十进制结果是否相同？当系数增长到数千位时它们算得有多快？只有在两个答案都正确时才报告速度，因此设计围绕一个不会因两个库彼此一致而被蒙蔽的正确性检查展开。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:12
msgid "The [API page](../api/dzmingli_vs_floating.md) lists the items, and the [tutorial](../tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md) runs them. Measured numbers are in the [performance chapter](../performance/dzmingli_vs_floating.md)."
msgstr "[API 页](../api/dzmingli_vs_floating.md)列出各条目，[教程](../tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md)运行它们。测量数据见[性能章节](../performance/dzmingli_vs_floating.md)。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:16
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:20
msgid "Mathematical background"
msgstr "数学背景"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:18
msgid "Decimal values"
msgstr "十进制值"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:20
msgid "A finite decimal is a pair $(c, s) \\in \\mathbb{Z} \\times \\mathbb{Z}$ that denotes"
msgstr "有限十进制数是一个对 $(c, s) \\in \\mathbb{Z} \\times \\mathbb{Z}$，它表示"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:27
msgid "The map $v$ is not injective: $(c, s)$ and $(10c, s + 1)$ denote the same number. GDA arithmetic keeps such pairs apart (the exponent is part of the result), while the benchmark compares numbers. It therefore needs a canonical representative of each class; the package uses the pair with $s \\ge 0$ and the fewest trailing zeros in $c$."
msgstr "映射 $v$ 不是单射：$(c, s)$ 与 $(10c, s + 1)$ 表示同一个数。GDA 算术区分这样的对（指数是结果的一部分），而基准比较的是数。因此它需要每个等价类的一个规范代表；本包取 $s \\ge 0$ 且 $c$ 末尾零最少的那个对。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:33
msgid ""
"For $c \\n"
"e 0$ write $d(c)$ for the number of decimal digits of $|c|$, so that"
msgstr ""
"对 $c \\n"
"e 0$，记 $d(c)$ 为 $|c|$ 的十进制位数，于是"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:39
msgid "`working_precision` computes $d$ as the length of the decimal string of $|c|$, which gives $d(0) = 1$."
msgstr "`working_precision` 把 $d$ 计算为 $|c|$ 的十进制字符串长度，因此 $d(0) = 1$。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:42
msgid "Precision and rounding toward zero"
msgstr "精度与向零舍入"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:44
msgid "A GDA context with precision $p$ represents exactly the numbers $c \\cdot 10^{e}$ with $|c| < 10^{p}$ and $e$ in the exponent range. An operation computes the exact result $x$ and rounds it to such a number. With rounding mode `Down` (toward zero) the result is"
msgstr "精度为 $p$ 的 GDA 上下文恰好表示满足 $|c| < 10^{p}$ 且 $e$ 在指数范围内的数 $c \\cdot 10^{e}$。运算先计算精确结果 $x$，再把它舍入为这样的数。舍入模式为 `Down`（向零）时，结果为"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:55
msgid "so $|\\operatorname{round}_p(x)| \\le |x|$, with equality exactly when $x$ has at most $p$ significant digits. The same truncation at a fixed number $k$ of fractional digits is written"
msgstr "因此 $|\\operatorname{round}_p(x)| \\le |x|$，当且仅当 $x$ 至多有 $p$ 位有效数字时取等号。在固定的 $k$ 位小数处做同样的截断，记为"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:63
msgid "Differential testing with a reference oracle"
msgstr "带参考预言机的差分测试"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:65
msgid "Let $I_1, I_2$ be the implementations under test, $O$ an oracle and $\\kappa$ a canonicalization map into a set where equality is decidable. For an input $x$ the verdict of implementation $k$ is"
msgstr "设 $I_1, I_2$ 为被测实现，$O$ 为预言机，$\\kappa$ 为映到一个可判定相等的集合的规范化映射。对输入 $x$，实现 $k$ 的判定为"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:73
msgid "Pairwise differential testing checks only $\\kappa(I_1(x)) = \\kappa(I_2(x))$. That check is blind to common-mode errors, where both implementations share a wrong result, and when it fails it does not say which side is wrong. With an oracle each implementation is judged on its own, and a disagreement between the two is explained by the verdicts."
msgstr "成对差分测试只检查 $\\kappa(I_1(x)) = \\kappa(I_2(x))$。这种检查对共模错误视而不见——即两个实现给出同一个错误结果——而且失败时也不能说明是哪一方出错。有了预言机，每个实现都被单独评判，两者的分歧也可由各自的判定来解释。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:81
msgid "Three implementations, two of them measured"
msgstr "三个实现，测量其中两个"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:83
msgid "**Problem.** The benchmark has to separate \"fast\" from \"fast and wrong\". **Options.** Pairwise agreement between the libraries; one library as the reference for the other; an independent oracle. **Choice.** An independent exact oracle over `BigInt`, run outside timing on every dataset (`ValidationCoverage::EveryDataset`). **Why.** The oracle is small enough to review line by line, shares no code with either library, and it found the 108 DzmingLi failures from 4,096 digits on, which pairwise agreement would have reported only as \"the libraries differ\". A size enters the speedup plots only when every validation at that size passed for both implementations."
msgstr "**问题。** 基准必须把“快”与“快但错”区分开。**选项。** 两个库之间的成对一致；以一个库作为另一个库的参考；独立的预言机。**选择。** 基于 `BigInt` 的独立精确预言机，在计时之外对每个数据集运行（`ValidationCoverage::EveryDataset`）。**理由。** 预言机小到可以逐行审查，与两个库都不共享代码，并且它发现了 DzmingLi 从 4,096 位起的 108 个失败，而成对一致只会把这些报告成“两个库不同”。只有当某规模下两个实现的所有校验都通过时，该规模才进入加速比图。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:93
msgid "A neutral representation and a zero tolerance"
msgstr "中立表示与零容差"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:95
msgid "**Problem.** The two libraries print results differently (exponent notation, trailing zeros, sign of zero), and approximate comparisons would hide real errors. **Choice.** Every result is parsed into `DecimalValue` and compared by `canonical_string` equality, a tolerance of exactly zero. **Why.** All benchmarked operations have an exactly representable result under the precision contract below, so a correct implementation must reproduce it digit for digit; the soundness argument is in [Correctness and invariants](#correctness-and-invariants). The price is that the comparison ignores the exponent cohort and the status flags; the official decTest audit (`tools/run_dzmingli_dectest_audit.sh`) covers those."
msgstr "**问题。** 两个库输出结果的方式不同（指数记法、末尾零、零的符号），而近似比较会掩盖真实错误。**选择。** 每个结果都解析为 `DecimalValue`，并按 `canonical_string` 是否相等来比较，即容差恰好为零。**理由。** 在下文的精度约定下，所有被测运算的结果都可精确表示，因此正确的实现必须逐位复现它；可靠性论证见[正确性与不变量](#correctness-and-invariants)。代价是比较忽略了指数同类（cohort）和状态标志；官方 decTest 审计（`tools/run_dzmingli_dectest_audit.sh`）覆盖这些方面。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:106
msgid "The exact-finite oracle"
msgstr "精确有限预言机"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:108
msgid "The oracle uses only integer operations on coefficients."
msgstr "预言机只对系数使用整数运算。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:110
msgid "Addition and subtraction align both operands to $s = \\max(s_\\ell, s_r)$:"
msgstr "加法与减法把两个操作数对齐到 $s = \\max(s_\\ell, s_r)$："

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:117
msgid "Multiplication multiplies coefficients and adds scales. Division writes the quotient as a fraction of integers and reduces it,"
msgstr "乘法将系数相乘、标度相加。除法把商写成整数分数并约分，"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:126
msgid "and accepts it only if $M'$ has no prime factor other than $2$ and $5$. It then finds the least $k$ with $M' \\mid N' 10^{k}$ and returns $(N' 10^{k} / M',\\ k)$. Integer division, remainder, power, square root of perfect squares, FMA and the unary operations follow from these rules; the table on the [API page](../api/dzmingli_vs_floating.md#oracle_operation3) lists them."
msgstr "并且只有当 $M'$ 不含 $2$ 和 $5$ 以外的素因子时才接受。然后它找出满足 $M' \\mid N' 10^{k}$ 的最小 $k$，并返回 $(N' 10^{k} / M',\\ k)$。整数除法、余数、幂、完全平方数的平方根、FMA 和一元运算都由这些规则推出；[API 页](../api/dzmingli_vs_floating.md#oracle_operation3)上的表格列出了它们。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:133
msgid "The truncating rules (`DivideInteger`, `Quantize`, `Rescale`, `ToIntegralExact`, `ToIntegralValue`) truncate toward zero because `BigInt` division does. GDA's `quantize`, `rescale` and `to_integral_*` round with the context's mode, so both contexts use `Down`; any other mode would make the oracle wrong for those operations. In the published fixtures these operations are exact anyway (see the next decision)."
msgstr "截断类规则（`DivideInteger`、`Quantize`、`Rescale`、`ToIntegralExact`、`ToIntegralValue`）之所以向零截断，是因为 `BigInt` 除法如此。GDA 的 `quantize`、`rescale` 和 `to_integral_*` 按上下文的模式舍入，所以两个上下文都使用 `Down`；任何其他模式都会使预言机在这些运算上出错。在已发布的夹具中，这些运算本来就是精确的（见下一条决策）。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:140
msgid "Precision contract"
msgstr "精度约定"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:142
msgid "**Problem.** Every operation must be performed at a precision $p$ that holds the exact result, so that rounding never happens and the zero tolerance is fair. A larger $p$ is not free: the work of a GDA division can grow with the precision, so an oversized $p$ could time work that the result does not need. **Choice.** $p$ is computed per fixture from the operands, as the smallest simple bound on the number of digits of the exact result plus guard digits: `working_precision(op, ℓ, r) + 2`, with overrides for `Power` and `Fma`. **Why.** The derivations below show the bound holds for every operand class the runners generate, and that it also holds every operand exactly, so parsing at $p$ never rounds."
msgstr "**问题。** 每个运算都必须在能容纳精确结果的精度 $p$ 下执行，这样就永远不会发生舍入，零容差也才公平。更大的 $p$ 并非没有代价：GDA 除法的工作量会随精度增长，所以过大的 $p$ 可能会把结果不需要的工作也计入时间。**选择。** 按夹具根据操作数计算 $p$，取精确结果位数的最小简单上界再加保护位：`working_precision(op, ℓ, r) + 2`，并对 `Power` 和 `Fma` 另行处理。**理由。** 下面的推导表明，该界对运行器生成的每类操作数都成立，并且也能精确容纳每个操作数，因此以 $p$ 解析从不舍入。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:153
msgid "Write $d_\\ell, d_r, d_t$ for the operand digit counts and $m = \\max(d_\\ell, d_r) + |s_\\ell - s_r|$. The runners use these operands: `Add`, `Subtract`, `Multiply`, `Fma`, `Quantize` and `Compare` take generated operands with scales from the profiles $(0, 2)$, $(8, 18)$, $(28, 0)$; `Divide`, `DivideInteger` and `Remainder` divide a generated operand with scale $0$, $8$ or $28$ by $2$, $8$ or $25$; `Power` squares (exponent $2$); `SquareRoot` takes the square of a generated integer; `Quantize` uses the quantum $10^{-s_\\ell}$, `Rescale` the exponent $-s_\\ell$ and `ScaleB` the shift $0$; the remaining unary operations take integers."
msgstr "记 $d_\\ell, d_r, d_t$ 为操作数位数，$m = \\max(d_\\ell, d_r) + |s_\\ell - s_r|$。运行器使用如下操作数：`Add`、`Subtract`、`Multiply`、`Fma`、`Quantize` 和 `Compare` 取标度来自配置 $(0, 2)$、$(8, 18)$、$(28, 0)$ 的生成操作数；`Divide`、`DivideInteger` 和 `Remainder` 用标度为 $0$、$8$ 或 $28$ 的生成操作数除以 $2$、$8$ 或 $25$；`Power` 求平方（指数 $2$）；`SquareRoot` 取一个生成整数的平方；`Quantize` 使用量子 $10^{-s_\\ell}$，`Rescale` 使用指数 $-s_\\ell$，`ScaleB` 使用移位 $0$；其余一元运算取整数。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:191
msgid "Every $p$ in the table is at least $\\max(d_\\ell, d_r, d_t)$, so the operands themselves parse exactly. The `Power` and `Fma` overrides exist because `working_precision` alone gives $d_\\ell + d_r + 2$, which is $d_\\ell + 3$ for the exponent $2$ and too small to hold a square."
msgstr "表中每个 $p$ 都至少为 $\\max(d_\\ell, d_r, d_t)$，因此操作数本身能被精确解析。之所以要对 `Power` 和 `Fma` 另行处理，是因为单靠 `working_precision` 得到 $d_\\ell + d_r + 2$，对指数 $2$ 来说只有 $d_\\ell + 3$，不足以容纳平方。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:196
msgid "The contract is proven for these operand classes, not for every input. For a general terminating divisor $q = 2^{\\alpha}$ the quotient coefficient is $c_\\ell \\cdot 5^{\\alpha}$, which has about $d_\\ell + 0.699\\alpha$ digits, while the bound grows only by $d_r \\approx 0.301\\alpha + 1$. At $\\alpha = 13$ the bound fails: $1 / 8192 = 0.0001220703125$ needs $10$ digits, and $p = 1 + 4 + 4 = 9$. Such a fixture is not silently accepted; it is rejected by the oracle comparison, as the next section shows."
msgstr "该约定只对这些操作数类别得到证明，而不是对任意输入。对一般的有限除数 $q = 2^{\\alpha}$，商的系数为 $c_\\ell \\cdot 5^{\\alpha}$，约有 $d_\\ell + 0.699\\alpha$ 位，而界只增长 $d_r \\approx 0.301\\alpha + 1$。在 $\\alpha = 13$ 时界失效：$1 / 8192 = 0.0001220703125$ 需要 $10$ 位，而 $p = 1 + 4 + 4 = 9$。这样的夹具不会被悄悄接受；如下一节所示，它会被预言机比较拒绝。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:204
msgid "Timing scopes"
msgstr "计时范围"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:206
msgid "`OperationOnly` (`arithmetic_only`) times one public operation on operands that were parsed before timing. `FullPath` (`full_path`) also parses the canonical operand strings under the prepared context, which is what a caller that receives text pays. Both scopes run the same datasets with the same fingerprints, so their numbers describe the same inputs. Context construction, canonicalization, validation and reporting stay outside both scopes."
msgstr "`OperationOnly`（`arithmetic_only`）对计时前已解析的操作数计时一次公开运算。`FullPath`（`full_path`）还会在准备好的上下文中解析规范操作数字符串，这正是接收文本的调用者需要付出的代价。两个范围运行相同的数据集、具有相同的指纹，因此它们的数字描述的是相同的输入。上下文构造、规范化、校验和报告都位于两个范围之外。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:213
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:206
msgid "Paired statistics"
msgstr "配对统计"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:215
msgid "Mare Mark records, for every dataset $j$, repetition $r$ and block $b$, one calibrated latency per implementation. The package pairs DzmingLi and GDA samples that share $(j, r, b)$ and forms differences"
msgstr "对每个数据集 $j$、重复 $r$ 和分块 $b$，Mare Mark 为每个实现记录一个经校准的延迟。本包把共享 $(j, r, b)$ 的 DzmingLi 与 GDA 样本配对，并构造差值"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:223
msgid "If a sample is modelled as $t = \\mu_{\\mathrm{impl}} + \\beta_b + \\varepsilon$, with $\\beta_b$ a drift shared by the block (frequency changes, cache state), then $\\Delta_i = \\mu_{\\mathrm{GDA}} - \\mu_{\\mathrm{DZ}} + (\\varepsilon - \\varepsilon')$: the block effect cancels. `BalancedBlocks` alternates which implementation runs first, so order effects cancel on average as well. The reported quantities are"
msgstr "若把样本建模为 $t = \\mu_{\\mathrm{impl}} + \\beta_b + \\varepsilon$，其中 $\\beta_b$ 是该分块共享的漂移（频率变化、缓存状态），则 $\\Delta_i = \\mu_{\\mathrm{GDA}} - \\mu_{\\mathrm{DZ}} + (\\varepsilon - \\varepsilon')$：分块效应被抵消。`BalancedBlocks` 轮换先运行的实现，因此顺序效应平均而言也会抵消。报告的量为"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:235
msgid "and the decision is `gda_faster` when $\\delta \\le -3$, `dzmingli_faster` when $\\delta \\ge 3$, and `equivalent` otherwise. Medians have a breakdown point of 50 %, so the outliers that Mare Mark reports but does not remove cannot move them far. The $3\\,\\%$ threshold is a practical-significance margin, not a hypothesis test, and the report carries no confidence interval.[^iqr]"
msgstr "当 $\\delta \\le -3$ 时判定为 `gda_faster`，当 $\\delta \\ge 3$ 时为 `dzmingli_faster`，否则为 `equivalent`。中位数的崩溃点为 50 %，因此 Mare Mark 只报告而不剔除的离群值无法使其大幅偏移。$3\\,\\%$ 阈值是实际显著性的边际，而不是假设检验，报告也不含置信区间。[^iqr]"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:241
msgid "Mare Mark's `compare_paired` stores the interquartile range of the $\\Delta_i$ as its interval. It describes the spread of the paired differences, not the uncertainty of the median."
msgstr "Mare Mark 的 `compare_paired` 把 $\\Delta_i$ 的四分位距存为其区间。它描述的是配对差的离散程度，而不是中位数的不确定性。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:245
msgid "With three datasets per size and 20 confirmatory repetitions each, a valid size has 60 pairs."
msgstr "每个规模三个数据集、每个数据集 20 次确认性重复，一个有效规模就有 60 对。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:248
msgid "Operation-specific size ceilings"
msgstr "特定运算的规模上限"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:250
msgid "DzmingLi's `digit_count` evaluates `bit_length * 30103` in a 32-bit `Int`. The product overflows when"
msgstr "DzmingLi 的 `digit_count` 在 32 位 `Int` 中计算 `bit_length * 30103`。乘积在下述条件下溢出"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:259
msgid "A product of two $n$-digit operands has up to $2n$ digits, so multiplication, FMA and squaring can cross the limit from $n \\approx 10\\,738$. The scaling runner therefore stops all operations at 10,000 digits and runs only add, subtract, divide and compare at 16,384 and 20,000 digits. These are analytic bounds from the overflow condition; runs at 32,768 and 65,536 digits reproduced the abort."
msgstr "两个 $n$ 位操作数之积至多有 $2n$ 位，因此乘法、FMA 和平方从 $n \\approx 10\\,738$ 起就可能越过该界限。因此规模扩展运行器让所有运算止步于 10,000 位，只有 add、subtract、divide 和 compare 运行到 16,384 和 20,000 位。这些是由溢出条件得出的解析界；在 32,768 和 65,536 位上的运行复现了中止。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:266
#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench.md:30
#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common.md:29
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:213
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench.md:28
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common.md:28
msgid "Correctness and invariants"
msgstr "正确性与不变量"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:268
msgid ""
"**Canonical form.** For $c \\n"
"e 0$, `normalize` returns $(c', s')$ with $s' \\ge 0$ and ($s' = 0$ or $10 \\n"
"mid c'$), and $v(c', s') = v(c, s)$ because each step replaces $(10q, s)$ by $(q, s - 1)$. Two such pairs denote the same number only if they are equal:"
msgstr ""
"**规范形式。** 对 $c \\n"
"e 0$，`normalize` 返回满足 $s' \\ge 0$ 且（$s' = 0$ 或 $10 \\n"
"mid c'$）的 $(c', s')$，并且 $v(c', s') = v(c, s)$，因为每一步都把 $(10q, s)$ 换成 $(q, s - 1)$。两个这样的对只有在相等时才表示同一个数："

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:281
msgid "which contradicts the normal form of $(c_2, s_2)$; and $s_1 = s_2$ forces $c_1 = c_2$. `canonical_string` writes the sign, the digits of $|c'|$ and the point position $s'$, all of which are determined by the number, so string equality is number equality."
msgstr "这与 $(c_2, s_2)$ 的规范形式矛盾；而 $s_1 = s_2$ 迫使 $c_1 = c_2$。`canonical_string` 写出符号、$|c'|$ 的各位数字和小数点位置 $s'$，它们都由数本身决定，因此字符串相等即数相等。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:286
msgid "**Oracle division.** $N'/M'$ is in lowest terms. If $M' \\mid N' 10^{k}$ then, since $\\gcd(M', N') = 1$, $M' \\mid 10^{k} = 2^k 5^k$, so $M'$ has no prime factor other than $2$ and $5$. Conversely, if $M' = 2^{\\alpha} 5^{\\beta}$, the least such $k$ is $\\max(\\alpha, \\beta)$. The oracle checks the factorization before the loop, so the loop terminates, and the returned scale is the shortest exact one."
msgstr "**预言机除法。** $N'/M'$ 是既约分数。若 $M' \\mid N' 10^{k}$，则由于 $\\gcd(M', N') = 1$，有 $M' \\mid 10^{k} = 2^k 5^k$，所以 $M'$ 不含 $2$ 和 $5$ 以外的素因子。反之，若 $M' = 2^{\\alpha} 5^{\\beta}$，则最小的这样的 $k$ 为 $\\max(\\alpha, \\beta)$。预言机在循环之前先检查因子分解，所以循环必然终止，且返回的标度是最短的精确标度。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:293
msgid "**Integer square root.** The oracle iterates"
msgstr "**整数平方根。** 预言机迭代"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:300
msgid "where $D$ is the digit count of $n$. By the AM-GM inequality $(x + n/x)/2 \\ge \\sqrt{n}$, so every iterate is at least $\\lfloor \\sqrt{n} \\rfloor$; while $x_k > \\lfloor \\sqrt{n} \\rfloor$ we have $n / x_k < x_k$ and hence $x_{k+1} < x_k$. The sequence decreases strictly until it reaches $\\lfloor \\sqrt{n} \\rfloor$, where the loop stops. The oracle then requires $x^2 = n$, so a non-square input aborts instead of producing a rounded root."
msgstr "其中 $D$ 是 $n$ 的位数。由算术-几何平均不等式 $(x + n/x)/2 \\ge \\sqrt{n}$，每个迭代值都至少为 $\\lfloor \\sqrt{n} \\rfloor$；当 $x_k > \\lfloor \\sqrt{n} \\rfloor$ 时有 $n / x_k < x_k$，从而 $x_{k+1} < x_k$。序列严格递减直到达到 $\\lfloor \\sqrt{n} \\rfloor$，循环在此停止。随后预言机要求 $x^2 = n$，因此非平方输入会中止，而不是产生一个舍入后的根。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:308
msgid "**Soundness of the zero tolerance.** Let $x$ be the exact result and $p$ the fixture precision."
msgstr "**零容差的可靠性。** 设 $x$ 为精确结果，$p$ 为夹具精度。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:311
msgid "If $x$ has at most $p$ significant digits, a conforming GDA operation returns a number equal to $x$, because $x$ is its own correctly rounded value in every rounding mode. Then $\\kappa(I(x)) = \\kappa(O(x))$: a correct implementation is never rejected."
msgstr "若 $x$ 至多有 $p$ 位有效数字，符合规范的 GDA 运算返回一个等于 $x$ 的数，因为在任何舍入模式下 $x$ 都是它自己的正确舍入值。于是 $\\kappa(I(x)) = \\kappa(O(x))$：正确的实现永远不会被拒绝。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:315
msgid "If $x$ has more than $p$ digits, rounding toward zero gives $|\\operatorname{round}_p(x)| < |x|$, so the canonical strings differ and the validation fails: insufficient precision is never accepted."
msgstr "若 $x$ 多于 $p$ 位，向零舍入给出 $|\\operatorname{round}_p(x)| < |x|$，于是规范字符串不同，校验失败：精度不足永远不会被接受。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:318
msgid "Equality of canonical strings is equality of numbers, so no wrong result is ever accepted."
msgstr "规范字符串相等即数相等，因此错误的结果永远不会被接受。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:321
msgid "The precision contract establishes the premise of (1) for every generated operand class. Outside those classes (2) still holds, which makes the check fail-closed."
msgstr "精度约定为每一类生成的操作数确立了 (1) 的前提。在这些类别之外 (2) 仍然成立，这使检查是失败即关闭（fail-closed）的。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:325
msgid "**Determinism.** Operands are derived from Mare Mark's seeded `derive_seed(seed, \"<operation>:<digits>\", profile)`, never from the clock, so the same seed reproduces the same corpus and the same fingerprints. `generate_decimal` uses only the digits $1..9$; generated coefficients therefore have exactly the requested number of digits and no trailing zeros."
msgstr "**确定性。** 操作数由 Mare Mark 带种子的 `derive_seed(seed, \"<operation>:<digits>\", profile)` 导出，从不依赖时钟，因此相同的种子复现相同的语料和相同的指纹。`generate_decimal` 只使用数字 $1..9$，因此生成的系数恰好具有所要求的位数且没有末尾零。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:331
msgid "**Cost of the oracle.** With $n$-digit coefficients, addition is dominated by the alignment multiplication by $10^{|s_\\ell - s_r|}$, multiplication by one `BigInt` product, and division by a GCD and $\\max(\\alpha, \\beta)$ multiplications by $10$, where $M' = 2^{\\alpha} 5^{\\beta}$. All of it runs outside the timed region."
msgstr "**预言机的代价。** 对 $n$ 位系数，加法的主要开销是乘以 $10^{|s_\\ell - s_r|}$ 的对齐，乘法是一次 `BigInt` 乘积，除法是一次最大公约数加上 $\\max(\\alpha, \\beta)$ 次乘以 $10$，其中 $M' = 2^{\\alpha} 5^{\\beta}$。所有这些都在计时区域之外运行。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:337
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:231
msgid "Alternatives rejected"
msgstr "被否决的方案"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:339
msgid "**Pairwise agreement only.** Rejected: it cannot attribute a disagreement and misses shared errors."
msgstr "**只做成对一致性检查。** 否决：它无法归因分歧，也会漏掉共同的错误。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:341
msgid "**One library as the oracle for the other.** Rejected: the GDA library is one of the subjects, and the benchmark found DzmingLi failures that would then be indistinguishable from GDA failures."
msgstr "**以一个库作为另一个库的预言机。** 否决：GDA 库本身就是被测对象之一，而且基准发现的 DzmingLi 失败届时将无法与 GDA 失败区分。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:344
msgid "**Comparison with a tolerance** (ulps or relative error). Rejected: every benchmarked result is exact in decimal, so any nonzero tolerance would only hide errors."
msgstr "**带容差的比较**（ulp 或相对误差）。否决：每个被测结果在十进制下都是精确的，所以任何非零容差都只会掩盖错误。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:347
msgid "**A fixed large precision** such as $10^5$ digits. Rejected: it can inflate division work beyond the result and couples timing to an arbitrary constant."
msgstr "**固定的大精度**，例如 $10^5$ 位。否决：它可能使除法工作量超出结果所需，并把计时与一个任意常数绑定。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:350
msgid "**Random operands per run.** Rejected: results must be reproducible and fingerprints stable across timing scopes."
msgstr "**每次运行使用随机操作数。** 否决：结果必须可复现，指纹在不同计时范围之间也必须稳定。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:352
msgid "**Scaling benchmarks for `exp`, `ln` and `log10`.** Rejected: identity fixtures would not exercise their algorithms, and general results need an independent high-precision transcendental oracle. They are covered by the decTest audit only."
msgstr "**为 `exp`、`ln` 和 `log10` 做规模扩展基准。** 否决：恒等夹具无法触及它们的算法，而一般结果需要一个独立的高精度超越函数预言机。它们只由 decTest 审计覆盖。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:359
msgid "The package checks numeric values only. Exponent cohorts, trailing zeros of results, status flags, NaN, infinities and signed zero are outside the comparison; the decTest audit covers them."
msgstr "本包只检查数值。指数同类、结果的末尾零、状态标志、NaN、无穷大和带符号零都不在比较范围内；decTest 审计覆盖它们。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:362
msgid "Division is exercised with the terminating divisors $2$, $8$ and $25$ only. Repeating quotients and large denominators are not benchmarked, and the oracle rejects repeating quotients."
msgstr "除法只用有限除数 $2$、$8$ 和 $25$ 测试。循环小数商和大分母不在基准范围内，预言机也会拒绝循环小数商。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:365
msgid "`Parse` and `Format` are identity paths. They do not test GDA formatting; the decTest audit records DzmingLi's 329 `toSci` failures separately."
msgstr "`Parse` 与 `Format` 是恒等路径。它们不测试 GDA 的格式化；decTest 审计单独记录了 DzmingLi 的 329 个 `toSci` 失败。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:367
msgid "`OperandShape` is a label; the corpus is three deterministic scale profiles per size, not a random distribution."
msgstr "`OperandShape` 只是标签；语料是每个规模三个确定性的标度配置，而不是随机分布。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:369
msgid "The precision contract is proven for the generated operand classes listed above, not for arbitrary inputs."
msgstr "精度约定只对上面列出的生成操作数类别得到证明，而不是对任意输入。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:371
msgid "The executables run on the `native` target only; other targets print a message and exit."
msgstr "可执行程序只在 `native` 目标上运行；其他目标打印一条消息后退出。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:373
msgid "`DzmingLi/decimal@0.2.2` is deprecated in favour of `moonbit-community/decimal`; the benchmark keeps it pinned for a historical comparison."
msgstr "`DzmingLi/decimal@0.2.2` 已被弃用，改为 `moonbit-community/decimal`；基准为了历史对比而固定使用它。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench.md:1
msgid "dzmingli_vs_floating/bench design"
msgstr "dzmingli_vs_floating/bench 设计"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench.md:5
#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common.md:5
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench.md:5
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common.md:5
msgid "The executable turns the library package into a reproducible experiment: fixed operations, fixed sizes, a fixed seed and protocol, and output that keeps every raw record next to the summary."
msgstr "该可执行程序把库包变成一个可复现的实验：固定的运算、固定的规模、固定的种子与协议，并且输出把每条原始记录都保留在汇总旁边。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench.md:11
#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common.md:11
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench.md:11
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common.md:11
msgid "**Fixed seed `0xDEC1A1` and protocol.** The corpus and the execution order are reproducible, and the fingerprints in the JSONL identify each dataset."
msgstr "**固定种子 `0xDEC1A1` 与协议。** 语料和执行顺序可复现，JSONL 中的指纹标识每个数据集。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench.md:13
#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common.md:13
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench.md:13
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common.md:13
msgid "**Three datasets per size.** `expand_digit_scales(sizes, 3)` gives three operand profiles per size, so a result is not the accident of one operand pair; with 20 confirmatory repetitions this yields 60 paired samples."
msgstr "**每个规模三个数据集。** `expand_digit_scales(sizes, 3)` 为每个规模给出三种操作数配置，使结果不会只是某一对操作数的偶然；配合 20 次确认性重复，得到 60 个配对样本。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench.md:16
#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common.md:16
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench.md:16
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common.md:16
msgid "**Records on standard output, report on disk.** The JSONL can be piped and archived, and the HTML report is regenerated by every run."
msgstr "**记录写到标准输出，报告写到磁盘。** JSONL 可以通过管道传递并归档，HTML 报告每次运行都会重新生成。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench.md:18
#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common.md:18
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench.md:18
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common.md:18
msgid "**Abort after reporting.** A run with validation failures still writes its report, then exits with a failure so that scripts cannot mistake it for a clean run."
msgstr "**报告之后再中止。** 存在校验失败的运行仍会写出报告，然后以失败状态退出，使脚本不会把它误认为干净的运行。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench.md:21
#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common.md:21
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench.md:21
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common.md:21
msgid "**Native only.** The published numbers are native release measurements; a fallback `main` keeps `moon check --target all` working on other targets."
msgstr "**仅限 native。** 已发布的数字是 native release 测量；后备的 `main` 让 `moon check --target all` 在其他目标上也能工作。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench.md:24
msgid "Multiplication stops at 10,000 digits because DzmingLi's digit estimator overflows for products above about 21,475 digits; the other operations continue to 20,000 digits. The 14 extended operations stop at 1,024 digits to keep the run length reasonable. The derivation of the ceiling is in the [package design](../dzmingli_vs_floating.md#operation-specific-size-ceilings)."
msgstr "乘法止步于 10,000 位，因为 DzmingLi 的位数估计在乘积超过约 21,475 位时溢出；其他运算继续到 20,000 位。14 种扩展运算止步于 1,024 位，以使运行时长合理。上限的推导见[包设计](../dzmingli_vs_floating.md#operation-specific-size-ceilings)。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench.md:32
#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common.md:31
msgid "The executable validates every dataset before timing it, through the library's oracle. A size enters the paired statistics only through valid observations, as described in the [package design](../dzmingli_vs_floating.md)."
msgstr "该可执行程序在计时之前通过库的预言机校验每个数据集。如[包设计](../dzmingli_vs_floating.md)所述，一个规模只通过有效观测进入配对统计。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench.md:38
#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common.md:37
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench.md:36
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common.md:36
msgid "The executable does not parse arguments, choose sizes at run time, render Matplotlib figures or compare runs with each other. It describes one host and one target per run."
msgstr "该可执行程序不解析参数，不在运行时选择规模，不渲染 Matplotlib 图，也不在多次运行之间进行比较。每次运行只描述一台主机和一个目标。"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common.md:1
msgid "dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common design"
msgstr "dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common 设计"

#: manual/design/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common.md:24
msgid "The sizes are the coefficient lengths common in business decimals and in fixed-width formats (16 digits for decimal64; 28 is the maximum scale of `moonbitlang/x/decimal`). A separate executable keeps the short-number report independent of the long-running scaling report."
msgstr "这些规模是商业十进制数和定宽格式中常见的系数长度（decimal64 为 16 位；28 是 `moonbitlang/x/decimal` 的最大标度）。单独的可执行程序使短数报告独立于长时间运行的规模扩展报告。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:1
msgid "floating_vs_decmial_x design"
msgstr "floating_vs_decmial_x 设计"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:5
msgid "The package compares `moonbitlang/x/decimal` (X) and `Luna-Flow/floating/decimal_gda@0.7.1` (GDA) on the same inputs. The two libraries do not implement the same arithmetic: X keeps at most 28 fractional digits and truncates, GDA rounds to a significant-digit precision chosen by a context. A fair comparison therefore has to fix a semantic contract first, make both libraries meet it, prove that they meet it, and only then measure."
msgstr "本包在相同输入上比较 `moonbitlang/x/decimal`（X）与 `Luna-Flow/floating/decimal_gda@0.7.1`（GDA）。两个库实现的算术并不相同：X 至多保留 28 位小数并截断，GDA 则舍入到由上下文选择的有效数字精度。因此公平的比较必须先确定一个语义约定，让两个库都满足它，证明它们满足它，然后才进行测量。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:12
msgid "The [API page](../api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md) lists the items, the [tutorial](../tutorial/floating_vs_decmial_x.md) runs them, and the measured numbers are in the [performance chapter](../performance/floating_vs_decmial_x.md). The method shared with the DzmingLi benchmark (oracle verdicts, canonical form, paired statistics) is derived on the [dzmingli_vs_floating design page](dzmingli_vs_floating.md); this page states what differs."
msgstr "[API 页](../api/floating_vs_decmial_x.md)列出各条目，[教程](../tutorial/floating_vs_decmial_x.md)运行它们，测量数字见[性能章节](../performance/floating_vs_decmial_x.md)。与 DzmingLi 基准共享的方法（预言机判定、规范形式、配对统计）在 [dzmingli_vs_floating 设计页](dzmingli_vs_floating.md)中推导；本页说明不同之处。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:22
msgid "Two decimal models"
msgstr "两种十进制模型"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:24
msgid "An X decimal is a pair $(c, s)$ with $0 \\le s \\le 28$ denoting $c \\cdot 10^{-s}$; `Decimal::new` rejects other scales. Its operations are"
msgstr "X 十进制数是满足 $0 \\le s \\le 28$ 的对 $(c, s)$，表示 $c \\cdot 10^{-s}$；`Decimal::new` 拒绝其他标度。其运算为"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:35
msgid "where $\\lfloor\\!\\lfloor \\cdot \\rfloor\\!\\rfloor$ is integer division truncating toward zero and $\\operatorname{trunc}_k$ truncates toward zero to $k$ fractional digits, as defined on the [DzmingLi design page](dzmingli_vs_floating.md#precision-and-rounding-toward-zero). Addition, subtraction and comparison are exact. Because $s_\\ell \\le 28$, the exponent $28 - s_\\ell + s_r$ is never negative, so"
msgstr "其中 $\\lfloor\\!\\lfloor \\cdot \\rfloor\\!\\rfloor$ 是向零截断的整数除法，$\\operatorname{trunc}_k$ 向零截断到 $k$ 位小数，定义见 [DzmingLi 设计页](dzmingli_vs_floating.md#precision-and-rounding-toward-zero)。加法、减法和比较是精确的。由于 $s_\\ell \\le 28$，指数 $28 - s_\\ell + s_r$ 永远不为负，所以"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:46
msgid "exactly: X's quotient is the true quotient truncated to 28 fractional digits."
msgstr "精确成立：X 的商就是真实商截断到 28 位小数。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:48
msgid "A GDA operation in a context of precision $p$ with rounding `Down` returns $\\operatorname{round}_p(x)$, the exact result truncated to $p$ significant digits; `quantize(y, 10^{-28})` in the same context returns $\\operatorname{trunc}_{28}(y)$ when the result fits in $p$ digits."
msgstr "在精度为 $p$、舍入为 `Down` 的上下文中，GDA 运算返回 $\\operatorname{round}_p(x)$，即截断到 $p$ 位有效数字的精确结果；在同一上下文中，当结果能放入 $p$ 位时，`quantize(y, 10^{-28})` 返回 $\\operatorname{trunc}_{28}(y)$。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:53
msgid "Nested truncation"
msgstr "嵌套截断"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:55
msgid "Two facts about truncation carry the proofs below."
msgstr "关于截断的两个事实支撑着下面的证明。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:57
msgid "**Lemma 1.** For $t \\ge k$ and every real $x$, $\\operatorname{trunc}_k(\\operatorname{trunc}_t(x)) = \\operatorname{trunc}_k(x)$."
msgstr "**引理 1。** 对 $t \\ge k$ 和任意实数 $x$，$\\operatorname{trunc}_k(\\operatorname{trunc}_t(x)) = \\operatorname{trunc}_k(x)$。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:60
msgid "*Proof.* Let $x \\ge 0$ (the negative case is symmetric) and $G_j = 10^{-j}\\mathbb{Z}$. $\\operatorname{trunc}_j(x)$ is the largest point of $G_j$ not above $x$. Since $G_k \\subseteq G_t$, the point $z = \\operatorname{trunc}_k(x)$ lies in $G_t$ and $z \\le x$, so $z \\le \\operatorname{trunc}_t(x) \\le x$. The largest point of $G_k$ below $\\operatorname{trunc}_t(x)$ is therefore at least $z$ and at most the largest point of $G_k$ below $x$, which is $z$. $\\square$"
msgstr "*证明。* 设 $x \\ge 0$（负的情形对称），$G_j = 10^{-j}\\mathbb{Z}$。$\\operatorname{trunc}_j(x)$ 是 $G_j$ 中不超过 $x$ 的最大点。由于 $G_k \\subseteq G_t$，点 $z = \\operatorname{trunc}_k(x)$ 属于 $G_t$ 且 $z \\le x$，所以 $z \\le \\operatorname{trunc}_t(x) \\le x$。因此 $G_k$ 中不超过 $\\operatorname{trunc}_t(x)$ 的最大点至少为 $z$，且至多为 $G_k$ 中不超过 $x$ 的最大点，即 $z$。$\\square$"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:68
msgid "**Lemma 2.** For integers $N$ and $A, B > 0$, $\\lfloor\\!\\lfloor \\lfloor\\!\\lfloor N / A \\rfloor\\!\\rfloor / B \\rfloor\\!\\rfloor = \\lfloor\\!\\lfloor N / (AB) \\rfloor\\!\\rfloor$."
msgstr "**引理 2。** 对整数 $N$ 和 $A, B > 0$，$\\lfloor\\!\\lfloor \\lfloor\\!\\lfloor N / A \\rfloor\\!\\rfloor / B \\rfloor\\!\\rfloor = \\lfloor\\!\\lfloor N / (AB) \\rfloor\\!\\rfloor$。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:71
msgid "*Proof.* For $N \\ge 0$ write $N = qA + r$ with $0 \\le r < A$ and $q = uB + v$ with $0 \\le v < B$. Then $N = uAB + (vA + r)$ and $0 \\le vA + r \\le (B-1)A + A - 1 < AB$, so $u = \\lfloor N/(AB) \\rfloor$. Truncation toward zero is odd in $N$, which gives the negative case. $\\square$"
msgstr "*证明。* 对 $N \\ge 0$，写 $N = qA + r$，$0 \\le r < A$，以及 $q = uB + v$，$0 \\le v < B$。则 $N = uAB + (vA + r)$ 且 $0 \\le vA + r \\le (B-1)A + A - 1 < AB$，所以 $u = \\lfloor N/(AB) \\rfloor$。向零截断关于 $N$ 是奇函数，由此得到负的情形。$\\square$"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:78
msgid "Two semantic groups"
msgstr "两个语义组"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:80
msgid "**Problem.** For multiplication and division the libraries' native results differ as soon as a result needs more than 28 fractional digits, and timing two different computations says nothing. **Options.** Restrict the benchmark to inputs where both are exact; force GDA to reproduce X's policy; force X to reproduce GDA's. **Choice.** Two groups, reported separately: `ExactOverlap` restricts the inputs, `XCompatible` makes GDA reproduce X's policy with an extra `quantize`. **Why.** X has no context to configure, so only the GDA side can adapt; and the cost of that adaptation is part of what a GDA user pays for X's semantics. The two groups carry different timing scopes, `arithmetic_only` and `semantic_equivalent_pipeline`, and are never aggregated."
msgstr "**问题。** 对乘法和除法，一旦结果需要多于 28 位小数，两个库的原生结果就会不同，而对两种不同的计算计时毫无意义。**选项。** 把基准限制在两者都精确的输入上；强制 GDA 重现 X 的策略；强制 X 重现 GDA 的策略。**选择。** 分两个组，分别报告：`ExactOverlap` 限制输入，`XCompatible` 让 GDA 通过额外的 `quantize` 重现 X 的策略。**理由。** X 没有可配置的上下文，所以只有 GDA 一方能够适配；而这种适配的代价正是 GDA 用户为获得 X 语义所付出的一部分。两个组带有不同的计时范围 `arithmetic_only` 与 `semantic_equivalent_pipeline`，并且从不合并。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:92
msgid "One oracle for both groups"
msgstr "一个预言机服务两个组"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:94
msgid "The oracle implements X's policy: exact addition, subtraction and comparison, $\\operatorname{trunc}_{28}$ of the exact product when its scale exceeds 28, and $\\operatorname{trunc}_{28}$ of the quotient. For division with $k = 28 + s_r - s_\\ell$ it returns $\\lfloor\\!\\lfloor c_\\ell 10^{k} / c_r \\rfloor\\!\\rfloor$ when $k \\ge 0$ and $\\lfloor\\!\\lfloor \\lfloor\\!\\lfloor c_\\ell / 10^{-k} \\rfloor\\!\\rfloor / c_r \\rfloor\\!\\rfloor$ otherwise, which equals $\\lfloor\\!\\lfloor c_\\ell / (10^{-k} c_r) \\rfloor\\!\\rfloor$ by Lemma 2 (taking the sign of $c_r$ into $N$). Both cases are $\\operatorname{trunc}_{28}(a / b) \\cdot 10^{28}$."
msgstr "预言机实现 X 的策略：精确的加法、减法和比较，当精确积的标度超过 28 时取其 $\\operatorname{trunc}_{28}$，以及商的 $\\operatorname{trunc}_{28}$。对除法，记 $k = 28 + s_r - s_\\ell$，当 $k \\ge 0$ 时返回 $\\lfloor\\!\\lfloor c_\\ell 10^{k} / c_r \\rfloor\\!\\rfloor$，否则返回 $\\lfloor\\!\\lfloor \\lfloor\\!\\lfloor c_\\ell / 10^{-k} \\rfloor\\!\\rfloor / c_r \\rfloor\\!\\rfloor$，由引理 2（把 $c_r$ 的符号并入 $N$）它等于 $\\lfloor\\!\\lfloor c_\\ell / (10^{-k} c_r) \\rfloor\\!\\rfloor$。两种情形都等于 $\\operatorname{trunc}_{28}(a / b) \\cdot 10^{28}$。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:105
msgid "In `ExactOverlap` the truncation is the identity on every generated result, so the same oracle returns the exact value:"
msgstr "在 `ExactOverlap` 中，截断对每个生成的结果都是恒等映射，因此同一个预言机返回精确值："

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:108
msgid "multiplication fixtures use scale pairs with $s_\\ell + s_r = 14 \\le 28$;"
msgstr "乘法夹具使用满足 $s_\\ell + s_r = 14 \\le 28$ 的标度对；"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:109
msgid "division fixtures divide an integer by $2$, $4$, $5$, $8$ or $25$, whose reciprocals $5 \\cdot 10^{-1}$, $25 \\cdot 10^{-2}$, $2 \\cdot 10^{-1}$, $125 \\cdot 10^{-3}$ and $4 \\cdot 10^{-2}$ have at most three fractional digits;"
msgstr "除法夹具用 $2$、$4$、$5$、$8$ 或 $25$ 去除一个整数，它们的倒数 $5 \\cdot 10^{-1}$、$25 \\cdot 10^{-2}$、$2 \\cdot 10^{-1}$、$125 \\cdot 10^{-3}$ 和 $4 \\cdot 10^{-2}$ 至多有三位小数；"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:113
msgid "addition, subtraction and comparison are exact by definition."
msgstr "加法、减法和比较按定义就是精确的。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:115
msgid "Precision contracts"
msgstr "精度约定"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:117
msgid "The GDA precision $p$ is `working_precision(op, ℓ, r, semantics)` with no guard digits added. With $d_\\ell, d_r$ the coefficient digit counts and $m = \\max(d_\\ell, d_r) + |s_\\ell - s_r|$:"
msgstr "GDA 精度 $p$ 为 `working_precision(op, ℓ, r, semantics)`，不再加保护位。记 $d_\\ell, d_r$ 为系数位数，$m = \\max(d_\\ell, d_r) + |s_\\ell - s_r|$："

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:131
msgid "so every `ExactOverlap` result, and the `XCompatible` product before quantization, is exact in GDA. The `XCompatible` product is then quantized to $10^{-28}$ when $s_\\ell + s_r > 28$; the quantized coefficient has fewer digits than the exact one, so `quantize` succeeds and returns $\\operatorname{trunc}_{28}$ of the exact product, which is X's product."
msgstr "因此每个 `ExactOverlap` 结果以及量化之前的 `XCompatible` 积在 GDA 中都是精确的。当 $s_\\ell + s_r > 28$ 时，`XCompatible` 积再被量化到 $10^{-28}$；量化后的系数位数少于精确系数，所以 `quantize` 成功并返回精确积的 $\\operatorname{trunc}_{28}$，即 X 的积。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:137
msgid "For `XCompatible` division the precision is"
msgstr "对 `XCompatible` 除法，精度为"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:143
msgid "$I$ bounds the number of integer digits of the quotient:"
msgstr "$I$ 是商的整数位数的上界："

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:151
msgid "`divide` returns $\\operatorname{round}_p(a/b)$. If $|a/b| \\ge 1$ it has at most $I$ integer digits, so at least $p - I \\ge 30$ fractional digits survive; if $|a/b| < 1$ every kept digit is fractional and at least $p \\ge 31$ of them survive. In both cases $\\operatorname{round}_p(a/b) = \\operatorname{trunc}_t(a/b)$ on a grid with $t \\ge 30$, and Lemma 1 gives"
msgstr "`divide` 返回 $\\operatorname{round}_p(a/b)$。若 $|a/b| \\ge 1$，它至多有 $I$ 位整数，因此至少保留 $p - I \\ge 30$ 位小数；若 $|a/b| < 1$，保留的每一位都是小数，至少保留 $p \\ge 31$ 位。两种情况下都有 $\\operatorname{round}_p(a/b) = \\operatorname{trunc}_t(a/b)$，网格满足 $t \\ge 30$，由引理 1 得"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:163
msgid "The quantized coefficient has at most $I + 28 \\le p - 2$ digits, so `quantize` does not raise an invalid operation. The two extra digits beyond the 28 are guard digits; Lemma 1 needs none, but they keep the contract independent of how the quotient's last digit is produced."
msgstr "量化后的系数至多有 $I + 28 \\le p - 2$ 位，因此 `quantize` 不会引发无效运算。28 位之外多出的两位是保护位；引理 1 并不需要它们，但它们使约定与商的最后一位如何产生无关。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:168
msgid "This derivation assumes that `divide` receives the exact operands $a$ and $b$. The next section shows when the fixture breaks that assumption."
msgstr "这一推导假设 `divide` 收到的是精确的操作数 $a$ 和 $b$。下一节说明夹具何时打破这一假设。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:171
msgid "Known limitation: operand rounding in X-compatible division"
msgstr "已知限制：X 兼容除法中的操作数舍入"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:173
msgid "`prepare_fixture` parses the GDA operands with `Decimal::from_string(text, precision=p)`, which rounds half-even to $p$ significant digits. For `XCompatible` division $p$ depends on the digit difference $I$, not on the operand lengths, so operands longer than $p$ digits are rounded before the timed division runs. Two consequences follow."
msgstr "`prepare_fixture` 用 `Decimal::from_string(text, precision=p)` 解析 GDA 操作数，它按半偶舍入到 $p$ 位有效数字。对 `XCompatible` 除法，$p$ 取决于位数差 $I$ 而不是操作数长度，因此长于 $p$ 位的操作数会在计时的除法运行之前被舍入。由此产生两个后果。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:179
msgid "**Correctness is not guaranteed by construction.** With operands rounded to relative error at most $\\tfrac12 10^{1-p}$ each, the computed quotient differs from $a/b$ by up to about $|a/b| \\cdot 10^{1-p} < 10^{I + 1 - p} \\le 10^{-29}$, which can move a quotient across a multiple of $10^{-28}$. For example $a = 4\\underbrace{9\\cdots9}_{59}$ and $b = 10^{60}$ give $p = 31$; GDA parses $a$ as $5 \\cdot 10^{59}$ and returns $0.5$, while X and the oracle return $0.4999999999999999999999999999$. The published corpora pass validation because their quotients stay away from such boundaries; that is an empirical result for the recorded seed."
msgstr "**正确性无法由构造保证。** 每个操作数被舍入后相对误差至多为 $\\tfrac12 10^{1-p}$，计算出的商与 $a/b$ 最多相差约 $|a/b| \\cdot 10^{1-p} < 10^{I + 1 - p} \\le 10^{-29}$，这可能使商越过 $10^{-28}$ 的某个倍数。例如 $a = 4\\underbrace{9\\cdots9}_{59}$ 和 $b = 10^{60}$ 给出 $p = 31$；GDA 把 $a$ 解析为 $5 \\cdot 10^{59}$ 并返回 $0.5$，而 X 和预言机返回 $0.4999999999999999999999999999$。已发布的语料能通过校验，是因为它们的商远离这类边界；这是针对所记录种子的经验结果。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:188
msgid "**The timed work differs.** The fixtures pair operands with the same digit count $D$ and $p \\le 51$, so from $D = 64$ on GDA divides operands of at most 51 digits while X divides the full $D$-digit operands. The `x_compatible` division timings at 64 digits and above therefore do not compare equal work. The common-digit run ($D \\le 28 < p$) is not affected."
msgstr "**计时的工作量不同。** 夹具把位数相同为 $D$ 的操作数配对，且 $p \\le 51$，所以从 $D = 64$ 起，GDA 除的是至多 51 位的操作数，而 X 除的是完整的 $D$ 位操作数。因此 64 位及以上的 `x_compatible` 除法计时比较的并不是相同的工作量。常见位数运行（$D \\le 28 < p$）不受影响。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:194
msgid "Parsing the operands with a precision of at least $\\max(d_\\ell, d_r)$ and dividing in a context of precision $p$ would remove both effects. The benchmark code is unchanged on this branch; the limitation is recorded here and in the [performance chapter](../performance/floating_vs_decmial_x.md)."
msgstr "以至少 $\\max(d_\\ell, d_r)$ 的精度解析操作数，并在精度为 $p$ 的上下文中做除法，就能消除这两种影响。本分支上的基准代码没有改动；该限制记录在这里和[性能章节](../performance/floating_vs_decmial_x.md)中。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:199
msgid "Fixtures excluded from timing"
msgstr "排除在计时之外的夹具"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:201
msgid "Conversions to X and GDA values, the $10^{-28}$ quantum, the context, validation and canonicalization are all built or run outside timing. The timed body is `run_x` or `run_gda`: one public operation, plus the `quantize` step in the `XCompatible` pipeline."
msgstr "转换为 X 和 GDA 值、$10^{-28}$ 量子、上下文、校验和规范化都在计时之外构造或运行。计时主体是 `run_x` 或 `run_gda`：一次公开运算，在 `XCompatible` 流水线中再加上 `quantize` 步骤。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:208
msgid "The pairing, the relative delta $\\delta$ (here relative to the X median), the $3\\,\\%$ decision threshold and the speedup ratio are those of the [DzmingLi benchmark](dzmingli_vs_floating.md#paired-statistics), with X as the baseline: `x_speedup_vs_gda` above $1$ means X is faster."
msgstr "配对方式、相对差 $\\delta$（此处相对于 X 中位数）、$3\\,\\%$ 判定阈值和加速比与 [DzmingLi 基准](dzmingli_vs_floating.md#paired-statistics)相同，以 X 为基线：`x_speedup_vs_gda` 大于 $1$ 表示 X 更快。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:215
msgid "Canonical form and the soundness of the zero tolerance are proved on the [DzmingLi design page](dzmingli_vs_floating.md#correctness-and-invariants); the neutral-model code is identical."
msgstr "规范形式和零容差的可靠性在 [DzmingLi 设计页](dzmingli_vs_floating.md#correctness-and-invariants)中证明；中立模型的代码完全相同。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:218
msgid "`ExactOverlap`: every generated result is exact in both libraries and equal to the oracle, by the precision table and the identity of $\\operatorname{trunc}_{28}$ on those results."
msgstr "`ExactOverlap`：由精度表以及 $\\operatorname{trunc}_{28}$ 在这些结果上的恒等性，每个生成的结果在两个库中都是精确的，并等于预言机结果。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:221
msgid "`XCompatible` multiplication: X, GDA and the oracle all return $\\operatorname{trunc}_{28}$ of the exact product."
msgstr "`XCompatible` 乘法：X、GDA 和预言机都返回精确积的 $\\operatorname{trunc}_{28}$。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:223
msgid "`XCompatible` division: X and the oracle return $\\operatorname{trunc}_{28}(a/b)$ for all inputs. GDA does so whenever its operands have at most $p$ significant digits (Lemma 1); longer operands are the known limitation above."
msgstr "`XCompatible` 除法：X 和预言机对所有输入都返回 $\\operatorname{trunc}_{28}(a/b)$。只要操作数至多有 $p$ 位有效数字，GDA 也是如此（引理 1）；更长的操作数属于上面的已知限制。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:227
msgid "Comparison: X's `Compare::compare` returns the sign of a coefficient comparison at a common scale, which `normalize_order` maps to $\\{-1, 0, 1\\}$; GDA's `compare` returns the same values as decimals."
msgstr "比较：X 的 `Compare::compare` 返回在公共标度上比较系数的符号，`normalize_order` 把它映射到 $\\{-1, 0, 1\\}$；GDA 的 `compare` 以十进制数形式返回相同的值。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:233
msgid "**A single \"fair\" semantics for all operations.** Rejected: there is none that both libraries implement natively for products and quotients beyond 28 fractional digits."
msgstr "**对所有运算使用单一的“公平”语义。** 否决：对于超过 28 位小数的积和商，不存在两个库都原生实现的语义。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:236
msgid "**Making X imitate GDA.** Rejected: X has no precision or rounding context, so it would need extra rescaling outside its public API."
msgstr "**让 X 模仿 GDA。** 否决：X 没有精度或舍入上下文，因此需要在其公开 API 之外额外重新调整标度。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:238
msgid "**Comparing with a tolerance of one unit in the 28th place.** Rejected: both sides truncate deterministically, so exact agreement is required and achievable."
msgstr "**以第 28 位上一个单位的容差进行比较。** 否决：两边都确定性地截断，因此要求且能够做到精确一致。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:241
msgid "**One combined score per operation.** Rejected: `arithmetic_only` and `semantic_equivalent_pipeline` time different work."
msgstr "**每种运算一个合并分数。** 否决：`arithmetic_only` 与 `semantic_equivalent_pipeline` 计时的是不同的工作。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:246
msgid "Only add, subtract, multiply, divide and compare are measured. X has no context, flags, special values or exponent cohorts, so none of those are compared."
msgstr "只测量 add、subtract、multiply、divide 和 compare。X 没有上下文、标志、特殊值或指数同类，因此这些都不做比较。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:249
msgid "The `XCompatible` division contract holds only for operands that GDA parses exactly; see the known limitation."
msgstr "`XCompatible` 除法约定只对 GDA 能精确解析的操作数成立；参见已知限制。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:251
msgid "The HTML corpus summary reports total `validation_count + failed_count` and passed `validation_count`. Mare Mark's `validation_count` already includes failures, so the summary overstates both numbers whenever a run has failures. The published runs had none."
msgstr "HTML 语料汇总报告的总数为 `validation_count + failed_count`，通过数为 `validation_count`。Mare Mark 的 `validation_count` 已经包含失败，所以只要运行中有失败，汇总就会高估这两个数。已发布的运行没有失败。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:255
msgid "The Mare Mark implementation record names `moonbitlang/x@0.4.46`, while the module now depends on `moonbitlang/x@0.5.5`; the published measurements were taken with 0.4.46."
msgstr "Mare Mark 的实现记录写的是 `moonbitlang/x@0.4.46`，而模块现在依赖 `moonbitlang/x@0.5.5`；已发布的测量是用 0.4.46 进行的。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:258
msgid "`BigInt::from_string` returns wrong values for long inputs on the `wasm-gc` target of the current `moonbitlang/core`; a string of 3,584 nines already parses wrongly, and 4,096 nines parse to a 4,094-digit number. The package does not use it; the test `division precision follows the requested semantic contract` does, and its expected value `4097` was recorded from that wrong parse. The correct value is `4099`, which the `native` and `js` targets compute."
msgstr "在当前 `moonbitlang/core` 的 `wasm-gc` 目标上，`BigInt::from_string` 对长输入返回错误的值；3,584 个 9 组成的字符串就已解析错误，4,096 个 9 被解析为一个 4,094 位的数。本包不使用它；测试 `division precision follows the requested semantic contract` 使用了它，其期望值 `4097` 就是从那次错误解析中记录下来的。正确值是 `4099`，`native` 和 `js` 目标会算出该值。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:265
msgid "The executables run on the `native` target only, and results from different targets are never combined."
msgstr "可执行程序只在 `native` 目标上运行，来自不同目标的结果从不合并。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench.md:1
msgid "floating_vs_decmial_x/bench design"
msgstr "floating_vs_decmial_x/bench 设计"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench.md:24
msgid "The `x_compatible` division timings from 64 digits on compare GDA operands rounded to at most 51 digits with full-length X operands; see the [known limitation](../floating_vs_decmial_x.md#known-limitation-operand-rounding-in-x-compatible-division)."
msgstr "从 64 位起，`x_compatible` 除法计时比较的是被舍入到至多 51 位的 GDA 操作数与完整长度的 X 操作数；参见[已知限制](../floating_vs_decmial_x.md#known-limitation-operand-rounding-in-x-compatible-division)。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench.md:30
#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common.md:30
msgid "The executable validates every dataset before timing it, through the library's oracle. A size enters the paired statistics only through valid observations, as described in the [package design](../floating_vs_decmial_x.md)."
msgstr "该可执行程序在计时之前通过库的预言机校验每个数据集。如[包设计](../floating_vs_decmial_x.md)所述，一个规模只通过有效观测进入配对统计。"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common.md:1
msgid "floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common design"
msgstr "floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common 设计"

#: manual/design/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common.md:24
msgid "At these sizes every division precision is at least 31 digits, longer than any operand, so the operand-rounding limitation of `x_compatible` division does not occur and both semantic groups compare equal work."
msgstr "在这些规模下，每个除法精度都至少为 31 位，长于任何操作数，因此 `x_compatible` 除法的操作数舍入限制不会出现，两个语义组比较的都是相同的工作量。"

#: manual/index.md:1
msgid "diff_bench"
msgstr "diff_bench"

#: manual/index.md:3
msgid "`diff_bench` holds differential correctness and performance benchmarks for Luna-Flow MoonBit packages. Each benchmark runs two decimal libraries on the same inputs, checks both against an independent `BigInt` oracle, and measures them with [Mare Mark](https://lunaflow.cn/en/mare_mark/) only where the results are right. The subject on the Luna-Flow side is [floating](https://lunaflow.cn/en/floating/)'s `decimal_gda` package."
msgstr "`diff_bench` 收录 Luna-Flow MoonBit 包的差分正确性与性能基准。每个基准在相同输入上运行两个十进制库，用独立的 `BigInt` 预言机检验两者，并且只在结果正确时用 [Mare Mark](https://lunaflow.cn/en/mare_mark/) 测量它们。Luna-Flow 一侧的被测对象是 [floating](https://lunaflow.cn/en/floating/) 的 `decimal_gda` 包。"

#: manual/index.md:10
msgid "The repository is a GitHub-only reference project. It is not published on mooncakes and is not meant as a runtime dependency."
msgstr "本仓库是仅在 GitHub 上提供的参考项目。它没有发布到 mooncakes，也不打算作为运行时依赖。"

