#: manual/index.md:30
msgid "Reading paths"
msgstr "阅读路径"

#: manual/index.md:32
msgid "**First time here.** Read the [`dzmingli_vs_floating` tutorial](tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md): it checks one division against the oracle in a dozen lines and then reproduces the published run."
msgstr "**初次来访。** 阅读 [`dzmingli_vs_floating` 教程](tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md)：它用十几行代码把一次除法与预言机核对，然后复现已发布的运行。"

#: manual/index.md:37
msgid "**Reading the results.** Start with the performance pages, then the design pages for what the numbers mean: the [precision contract](design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md#precision-contract), the [paired statistics](design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md#paired-statistics) and the [semantic groups](design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md#two-semantic-groups) of the X comparison."
msgstr "**解读结果。** 先看性能页面，再看设计页面了解数字的含义：[精度约定](design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md#precision-contract)、[配对统计](design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md#paired-statistics)以及 X 比较的[语义组](design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md#two-semantic-groups)。"

#: manual/index.md:44
msgid "**Contributing.** Read both design pages, then the [contribution guidelines](contributing.md). A new operation needs an oracle rule, a precision bound with a proof, and a test before it is timed."
msgstr "**参与贡献。** 阅读两份设计页，然后阅读[贡献指南](contributing.md)。新增运算在计时之前需要一条预言机规则、一个带证明的精度界和一个测试。"

#: manual/index.md:48
msgid "Method in one paragraph"
msgstr "一段话概述方法"

#: manual/index.md:50
msgid "Every input is materialized from a fixed seed into a neutral decimal $(c, s) \\mapsto c \\cdot 10^{-s}$, converted to each library outside timing, and computed at a precision that provably holds the exact result. Results are canonicalized and compared with the oracle by exact equality. Timed samples of the two libraries are paired by dataset, repetition and block, and summarized by medians."
msgstr "每个输入都由固定种子实例化为中立十进制数 $(c, s) \\mapsto c \\cdot 10^{-s}$，在计时之外转换为各库的表示，并在一个可证明能容纳精确结果的精度下计算。结果被规范化后与预言机按精确相等进行比较。两个库的计时样本按数据集、重复和分块配对，并用中位数汇总。"

#: manual/index.md:57
msgid "Artifacts and tools"
msgstr "制品与工具"

#: manual/index.md:59
msgid "Raw JSONL records, HTML reports, Plot IR and the PNG, PDF and SVG figures are kept under `artifacts/<package>/`, outside the manual. The `tools/` directory holds the Python figure layouts (`plot_dzmingli_benchmark.py`, `plot_dzmingli_supplementary_benchmark.py`, `layout_x_decimal.py`, sharing `mare_plot_ir.py`) and the official decTest audit (`run_dzmingli_dectest_audit.sh`)."
msgstr "原始 JSONL 记录、HTML 报告、Plot IR 以及 PNG、PDF 和 SVG 图都保存在手册之外的 `artifacts/<package>/` 下。`tools/` 目录包含 Python 图形布局（`plot_dzmingli_benchmark.py`、`plot_dzmingli_supplementary_benchmark.py`、`layout_x_decimal.py`，共用 `mare_plot_ir.py`）以及官方 decTest 审计（`run_dzmingli_dectest_audit.sh`）。"

#: manual/index.md:66
msgid "Toolchain"
msgstr "工具链"

#: manual/index.md:68
msgid "The code targets MoonBit `moonc` 0.10 or later with the `moon.mod` and `moon.pkg` manifests. The library packages build on every target; the executables and the asynchronous Mare Mark runs need `native` (the async runner also works on `js`). Published measurements are native release runs."
msgstr "代码面向 MoonBit `moonc` 0.10 或更高版本，使用 `moon.mod` 与 `moon.pkg` 清单。库包可在所有目标上构建；可执行程序和异步的 Mare Mark 运行需要 `native`（异步运行器也可在 `js` 上工作）。已发布的测量是 native release 运行。"

#: manual/index.md:78
msgid "On `native` and `js` one test fails: `division precision follows the requested semantic contract` expects `4097`, a value recorded on `wasm-gc`, where `BigInt::from_string` in `moonbitlang/core` misparses long inputs. The correct value is `4099`; see the [`floating_vs_decmial_x` design](design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md#boundaries)."
msgstr "在 `native` 和 `js` 上有一个测试失败：`division precision follows the requested semantic contract` 期望 `4097`，这是在 `wasm-gc` 上记录的值，而 `moonbitlang/core` 中的 `BigInt::from_string` 在该目标上会错误解析长输入。正确值是 `4099`；参见 [`floating_vs_decmial_x` 设计](design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md#boundaries)。"

#: manual/performance/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:1
msgid "dzmingli_vs_floating performance"
msgstr "dzmingli_vs_floating 性能"

#: manual/performance/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:3
msgid "Measurement environment"
msgstr "测量环境"

#: manual/performance/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:5
msgid "The numbers come from one native release run on an Apple M4 under macOS 26.5 with `moon 0.1.20260703`, `DzmingLi/decimal@0.2.2`, `Luna-Flow/floating@0.7.1` and `Luna-Flow/mare_mark@0.3.0`, recorded on 2026-07-15. CPU frequency was not controlled. The MoonBit 0.10 migration on this branch changes no benchmark logic and the run has not been repeated with the new toolchain. The measurement method is derived on the [design page](../design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md#paired-statistics)."
msgstr "这些数字来自一次 native release 运行：Apple M4、macOS 26.5、`moon 0.1.20260703`、`DzmingLi/decimal@0.2.2`、`Luna-Flow/floating@0.7.1` 和 `Luna-Flow/mare_mark@0.3.0`，记录于 2026-07-15。CPU 频率未受控制。本分支上的 MoonBit 0.10 迁移没有改变任何基准逻辑，运行也尚未用新工具链重复。测量方法在[设计页](../design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md#paired-statistics)中推导。"

#: manual/performance/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:13
#: manual/performance/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:7
msgid "Results"
msgstr "结果解读"

#: manual/performance/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:15
msgid "The current `0.7.1` run contains 1,476 scaling validations, with 1,368 passes and 108 DzmingLi failures. The expanded common-digit run contains 1,368/1,368 successful validations for 19 operations."
msgstr "当前 `0.7.1` 基准的 scaling 共执行 1,476 次校验，其中 1,368 次通过、DzmingLi 失败 108 次。扩展 common-digits 对 19 个操作执行 1,368 次校验并全部通过。"

#: manual/performance/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:19
msgid "At 1,024 digits, where both implementations still pass the oracle, floating GDA records `0.978–16.798 µs/op` for the five arithmetic-only operations versus DzmingLi's `12.459–78.978 µs/op`. Full-path medians are `7.427–24.133 µs/op` versus `152.145–205.549 µs/op`. The resulting GDA speedup ranges from `3.54×` for arithmetic-only multiplication to `95.44×` for arithmetic-only comparison."
msgstr "在双方都通过 oracle 的 1,024 位，floating GDA 的 arithmetic-only 中位数为 `0.978–16.798 µs/op`，DzmingLi 为 `12.459–78.978 µs/op`；full-path 分别为 `7.427–24.133 µs/op` 与 `152.145–205.549 µs/op`。GDA 的 speedup 随操作和 scope 为 `3.54–95.44×`。"

#: manual/performance/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:25
msgid "DzmingLi arithmetic is incorrect from 4,096 digits, so those points are not speedups. At 20,000 digits the validated GDA medians are `14.810 µs` add, `15.083 µs` subtract, `60.588 µs` divide, and `0.130 µs` compare for arithmetic-only; full-path medians are `154.468`, `155.582`, `131.363`, and `139.865 µs`, respectively."
msgstr "DzmingLi 从 4,096 位开始算术不正确，因此这些点不能解释为 speedup。20,000 位时，已验证的 GDA arithmetic-only 加、减、除、比较分别为 `14.810`、`15.083`、`60.588`、`0.130 µs/op`；full-path 分别为 `154.468`、`155.582`、`131.363`、`139.865 µs/op`。"

#: manual/performance/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:31
msgid "Data-dependent comparison"
msgstr "依赖数据的比较"

#: manual/performance/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:33
msgid "DzmingLi's arithmetic-only comparison curve remains data-dependent at large input sizes: its medians at 4,096, 8,192, 10,000, 16,384, and 20,000 digits are `105.918`, `0.103`, `675.705`, `0.101`, and `2,203.063 µs/op`. Some fixtures can be ordered immediately from sign, exponent, or significant-digit metadata, while others require a deep coefficient comparison. The connected curve therefore contains execution-class spikes rather than a single digit-count scaling law. Full-path timing also includes parsing and construction costs; comparison should be evaluated by input class as well as coefficient size."
msgstr "DzmingLi 的 arithmetic-only 比较在大规模输入处仍表现出数据相关短路：4,096、8,192、10,000、16,384 和 20,000 位的中位数依次为 `105.918`、`0.103`、`675.705`、`0.101` 和 `2,203.063 µs/op`。部分 fixture 可由符号、指数或有效位数等元数据立即判定，另一些则需要深入比较长系数，因此不能把折线尖峰解释为单一的位数伸缩规律。"

#: manual/performance/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:42
#: manual/performance/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:23
msgid "Data and figures"
msgstr "数据与图表"

#: manual/performance/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:44
msgid "The figures and reports for this analysis are kept in the repository: the [main figure](../../../artifacts/dzmingli_vs_floating/main.svg), the [supplementary figure](../../../artifacts/dzmingli_vs_floating/supplementary.svg), the [scaling report](../../../artifacts/dzmingli_vs_floating/scaling.html) and the [common-digit report](../../../artifacts/dzmingli_vs_floating/common_digits.html), with the JSONL records and the Plot IR beside them."
msgstr "本分析使用的图表和报告保存在仓库中：[主图](../../../artifacts/dzmingli_vs_floating/main.svg)、[补充图](../../../artifacts/dzmingli_vs_floating/supplementary.svg)、[scaling 报告](../../../artifacts/dzmingli_vs_floating/scaling.html)和[常见位数报告](../../../artifacts/dzmingli_vs_floating/common_digits.html)，JSONL 记录和 Plot IR 位于同一目录。"

#: manual/performance/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:1
msgid "floating_vs_decmial_x performance"
msgstr "floating_vs_decmial_x 性能"

#: manual/performance/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:3
msgid "Measurement contract"
msgstr "测量口径"

#: manual/performance/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:5
msgid "This report covers a MoonBit native release run comparing `moonbitlang/x/decimal@0.4.46` and `Luna-Flow/floating/decimal_gda@0.7.1`, taken before the MoonBit 0.10 migration. The module now depends on `moonbitlang/x@0.5.5`; the run has not been repeated with it. Fixture construction, parsing, conversion, correctness checks, and formatting are outside the timed region. `exact_overlap` measures shared mathematical semantics; `x_compatible` also includes 28 fractional digits and truncation toward zero."
msgstr "本报告涵盖一次 MoonBit native release 运行，比较 `moonbitlang/x/decimal@0.4.46` 与 `Luna-Flow/floating/decimal_gda@0.7.1`，在 MoonBit 0.10 迁移之前进行。模块现在依赖 `moonbitlang/x@0.5.5`；尚未用它重复运行。夹具构造、解析、转换、正确性检查和格式化都在计时区域之外。`exact_overlap` 测量共同的数学语义；`x_compatible` 还包括 28 位小数和向零截断。"

#: manual/performance/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:9
msgid "**Add/subtract:** GDA leads at 1–256 digits (`0.23–0.39 µs/op` versus X's `0.46–0.66 µs/op`); X leads at 1,024–4,096 digits and is about `1.4–1.8×` faster at the upper end."
msgstr "**加减**：1–256 位时 GDA 领先（`0.23–0.39 µs/op`，X 为 `0.46–0.66 µs/op`）；1,024–4,096 位时 X 反超，末端约快 `1.4–1.8×`。"

#: manual/performance/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:10
msgid "**Multiply:** X leads at every scaling point by about `2.1–2.7×`, a constant-factor advantage in this workload rather than evidence of a different complexity class."
msgstr "**乘法**：X 在所有规模领先约 `2.1–2.7×`；这是当前工作负载中的常数因子差异，不能据此断言复杂度类别不同。"

#: manual/performance/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:11
msgid "**Divide:** For `exact_overlap`, GDA leads by `1.2–4.1×` at 1–64 digits, while X leads by `1.3–3.4×` at 256–4,096 digits. In `x_compatible`, the two implementations stay within about `1.2×` through 256 digits, then GDA leads by about `1.8×` at 1,024 and `3.8×` at 4,096 digits."
msgstr "**除法**：`exact_overlap` 下，1–64 位 GDA 快约 `1.2–4.1×`，256–4,096 位 X 快约 `1.3–3.4×`。`x_compatible` 在 256 位以内相差约不超过 `1.2×`，到 1,024 和 4,096 位时 GDA 分别快约 `1.8×` 和 `3.8×`。"

#: manual/performance/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:12
msgid "**Divide caveat:** from 64 digits on, the `x_compatible` fixtures round the GDA operands to the division precision (at most 51 digits) while X divides the full operands, so these GDA timings measure less work; see the [known limitation](../design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md#known-limitation-operand-rounding-in-x-compatible-division). The 1–16-digit points and the whole common-digit run are not affected."
msgstr "**除法注意事项：** 从 64 位起，`x_compatible` 夹具把 GDA 操作数舍入到除法精度（至多 51 位），而 X 除的是完整操作数，因此这些 GDA 计时测量的工作量更少；参见[已知限制](../design/floating_vs_decmial_x.md#known-limitation-operand-rounding-in-x-compatible-division)。1–16 位的数据点以及整个常见位数运行不受影响。"

#: manual/performance/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:13
msgid "**Compare:** GDA leads at every scaling point, from about `3.4×` at 1 digit to `14.8×` at 4,096 digits, consistent with early sign/coefficient-length/exponent shortcuts."
msgstr "**比较**：GDA 在所有规模领先，从 1 位约 `3.4×` 扩大到 4,096 位约 `14.8×`；符号、系数长度和指数的早期判定会减少 scale 对齐。"

#: manual/performance/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:15
msgid "Cross-implementation context"
msgstr "跨语言实现对照"

#: manual/performance/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:17
msgid "Fixed-precision decimal64/128 is often fastest within its bound. Arbitrary-precision add/subtract is commonly near `O(n)`, while multiply/divide depend on BigInt algorithms and thresholds. Mature C implementations may benefit from limb layout and SIMD/assembly. Full IEEE/GDA contexts pay for rounding, status flags, and special values."
msgstr "固定精度 decimal64/128 在范围内通常最快；任意精度实现的加减接近 `O(n)`，乘除取决于 BigInt 算法和阈值；成熟 C 实现可受益于 limb 布局和 SIMD/汇编；IEEE/GDA 完整上下文会为舍入、状态标志和特殊值支付额外开销。"

#: manual/performance/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:19
msgid "Conclusion and limits"
msgstr "结论与限制"

#: manual/performance/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:21
msgid "For this workload, X favors simple high-throughput arithmetic; GDA favors explicit precision, rounding, and context semantics. The observed ratio is broadly stable with size, supporting a constant-factor implementation gap rather than a different asymptotic class; larger BigInt sizes may expose thresholds. Other GDA implementations may have similar overhead with similar algorithms, but limb layout, caching, native code, fixed precision, or hardware can change constants; the standard does not prescribe an algorithm. Results are specific to these fixtures, target, build mode, and host. Recheck JSONL and `artifacts/` reports. This benchmark remains GitHub-only and is not published to Mooncakes."
msgstr "该工作负载下，X 更适合简单高吞吐算术，GDA 更适合完整 GDA/IEEE 语义。`decimal_gda` 的优势是显式精度、舍入模式与上下文传播；当前倍率随位数没有稳定放大，因此支持常数级实现差异，不支持复杂度量级不同。更大位数仍可能受 BigInt 阈值影响。其他 GDA 实现若采用类似任意精度与上下文，通常有相近常数开销；更优 limb、缓存、本地代码或固定精度会改变常数。GDA 标准不规定算法，不能外推本报告倍率。结果只代表当前 fixture、target、编译模式和主机；请通过 JSONL 原始观测和 `artifacts/` HTML 报告复核。该基准仅保留在 GitHub，不发布到 Mooncakes。"

#: manual/performance/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:25
msgid "The figures and reports for this analysis are kept in the repository: the [main figure](../../../artifacts/floating_vs_decmial_x/main.svg), the [scaling report](../../../artifacts/floating_vs_decmial_x/scaling.html) and the [common-digit report](../../../artifacts/floating_vs_decmial_x/common_digits.html), with the JSONL records and the Plot IR beside them."
msgstr "本分析使用的图表和报告保存在仓库中：[主图](../../../artifacts/floating_vs_decmial_x/main.svg)、[scaling 报告](../../../artifacts/floating_vs_decmial_x/scaling.html)和[常见位数报告](../../../artifacts/floating_vs_decmial_x/common_digits.html)，JSONL 记录和 Plot IR 位于同一目录。"

