#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:1
msgid "dzmingli_vs_floating tutorial"
msgstr "dzmingli_vs_floating 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows how to check `DzmingLi/decimal` and floating's `decimal_gda` against the exact oracle, first for one operation and then for a deterministic corpus, how to run a small Mare Mark measurement from a test, and how to reproduce the published benchmark and its official decTest audit. The mathematics behind the checks is on the [design page](../design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md)."
msgstr "本教程说明如何对照精确预言机检查 `DzmingLi/decimal` 和 floating 的 `decimal_gda`——先是单个运算，再是确定性语料——如何在测试中运行一次小型 Mare Mark 测量，以及如何复现已发布的基准及其官方 decTest 审计。检查背后的数学见[设计页](../design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:12
msgid "`diff_bench` is a GitHub-only repository; it is not published on mooncakes. Clone it and work inside the module, or add the clone to a `moon.work` workspace:"
msgstr "`diff_bench` 是仅在 GitHub 上的仓库，没有发布到 mooncakes。克隆它并在模块内工作，或把克隆加入一个 `moon.work` 工作区："

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:22
msgid "A package inside the module imports the benchmark package in its `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "模块内的包在其 `moon.pkg` 中导入基准包："

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:30
msgid "The smallest useful program checks one division in both libraries against the oracle:"
msgstr "最小的有用程序对照预言机检查两个库中的一次除法："

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:48
msgid "The three `inspect` lines are the output: the oracle and both libraries agree on $1.25 / 8 = 0.15625$."
msgstr "三行 `inspect` 就是输出：预言机与两个库在 $1.25 / 8 = 0.15625$ 上一致。"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:53
msgid "Check every operation family on one input"
msgstr "在一个输入上检查每个运算族"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:55
msgid "`oracle_operation3` and `prepare_fixture3` take a third operand for `Fma`; the other operations ignore it. The loop below checks 16 operations on inputs that suit them all: a perfect square for `SquareRoot`, an integer exponent for `Power`, and a zero shift for `ScaleB`."
msgstr "`oracle_operation3` 和 `prepare_fixture3` 为 `Fma` 接受第三个操作数；其他运算忽略它。下面的循环在适合全部运算的输入上检查 16 种运算：`SquareRoot` 用完全平方数，`Power` 用整数指数，`ScaleB` 用零移位。"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:88
msgid "All 16 operations agree in both libraries ($16 \\times 2 = 32$)."
msgstr "全部 16 种运算在两个库中都一致（$16 \\times 2 = 32$）。"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:90
msgid "Time with or without parsing"
msgstr "计时时包含或不包含解析"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:92
msgid "`run_dz` and `run_gda` use operands parsed before timing; `run_dz_full` and `run_gda_full` parse the canonical strings first. Both paths must give the same value, which is what the `FullPath` timing scope relies on:"
msgstr "`run_dz` 和 `run_gda` 使用计时前解析好的操作数；`run_dz_full` 和 `run_gda_full` 先解析规范字符串。两条路径必须给出相同的值，`FullPath` 计时范围正依赖于此："

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:112
msgid "Validate a deterministic corpus"
msgstr "校验确定性语料"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:114
msgid "`generate_cases` gives the same operands for the same seed. Divisions in such a corpus may not terminate, so the loop checks the operations whose results are always exact:"
msgstr "`generate_cases` 对相同的种子给出相同的操作数。这样的语料中的除法可能不能整除为有限小数，所以循环只检查结果总是精确的运算："

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:139
msgid "See what insufficient precision looks like"
msgstr "看看精度不足是什么样子"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:141
msgid "The fixture precision is chosen so that no result is rounded. If it were too small, rounding toward zero would shorten the result and the oracle comparison would fail. Here a product with six significant digits is computed in a four-digit context with floating's `decimal_gda` package (imported as `@decimal_gda`):"
msgstr "夹具精度的选择保证没有结果被舍入。如果它太小，向零舍入会缩短结果，预言机比较就会失败。这里用 floating 的 `decimal_gda` 包（以 `@decimal_gda` 导入），在四位精度的上下文中计算一个有六位有效数字的积："

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:164
msgid "`working_precision` asks for 9 digits, enough for the 6 digits of $827.115$."
msgstr "`working_precision` 要求 9 位，足以容纳 $827.115$ 的 6 位。"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:166
#: manual/tutorial/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:117
msgid "Run a small Mare Mark measurement"
msgstr "运行一次小型 Mare Mark 测量"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:168
msgid "`run_mare_benchmark` validates every dataset against the oracle and then times both libraries. It is `async`, so call it from an `async test` on the `native` or `js` target. `smoke_protocol` keeps the run short:"
msgstr "`run_mare_benchmark` 先对照预言机校验每个数据集，然后对两个库计时。它是 `async` 函数，因此要在 `native` 或 `js` 目标上从 `async test` 中调用。`smoke_protocol` 让运行保持简短："

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:188
msgid "Two operations × two datasets × two implementations give eight validations. Each result row pairs 2 datasets × 3 smoke repetitions = 6 samples; its latencies are `report.results[i].dz_median_us` and `gda_median_us`."
msgstr "两种运算 × 两个数据集 × 两个实现，得到八次校验。每个结果行配对 2 个数据集 × 3 次冒烟重复 = 6 个样本；其延迟为 `report.results[i].dz_median_us` 和 `gda_median_us`。"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:192
#: manual/tutorial/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:138
msgid "Reproduce the published benchmark"
msgstr "复现已发布的基准"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:194
msgid "Run from the repository root on the native release target:"
msgstr "在仓库根目录运行："

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:203
msgid "The scaling run takes a long time and exits nonzero after writing its complete report, because DzmingLi fails validation from 4,096 digits on. Check that every Mare Mark summary record says `\"complete\":true` before reading the numbers, and set `MARE_CPU`, `MARE_OS` and `MARE_BUILD_MODE` to record the host. The [bench page](dzmingli_vs_floating/bench.md) describes the outputs."
msgstr "规模扩展运行耗时很长，并在写完完整报告后以非零状态退出，因为 DzmingLi 从 4,096 位起校验失败。在读取数字之前，确认每条 Mare Mark summary 记录都写着 `\"complete\":true`，并设置 `MARE_CPU`、`MARE_OS` 和 `MARE_BUILD_MODE` 以记录主机。[bench 页](dzmingli_vs_floating/bench.md)描述了输出。"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:209
msgid "The official GDA decTest audit runs separately:"
msgstr "官方 GDA decTest 审计单独运行："

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:215
msgid "It downloads the decTest archive, checks its SHA-256, runs the shared operation files against both libraries and exits nonzero while DzmingLi's known `toSci` failures remain."
msgstr "它下载 decTest 归档，检查其 SHA-256，对两个库运行共享的运算文件；只要 DzmingLi 已知的 `toSci` 失败仍然存在，它就以非零状态退出。"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:219
#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench.md:49
#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating/bench_common.md:49
#: manual/tutorial/floating_vs_decmial_x.md:163
#: manual/tutorial/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench.md:49
#: manual/tutorial/floating_vs_decmial_x/bench_common.md:49
msgid "Going further"
msgstr "进阶"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:221
msgid "**Your own operand classes.** `prepare_fixture3` chooses the precision from the operands. The [precision contract](../design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md#precision-contract) is proven for the generated classes only; for new inputs, check that the exact result fits. If it does not, validation fails rather than passing silently, so a failing new fixture may point at the fixture before it points at a library."
msgstr "**你自己的操作数类别。** `prepare_fixture3` 根据操作数选择精度。[精度约定](../design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md#precision-contract)只对生成的类别得到证明；对新输入，请检查精确结果是否放得下。如果放不下，校验会失败而不是悄悄通过，因此一个失败的新夹具首先可能说明夹具有问题，而不是库有问题。"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:228
msgid "**Adding an operation.** Add a constructor to `Operation`, its name in `operation_name`, a rule in `oracle_operation3`, a precision line in `working_precision` (or an override in `prepare_fixture3`), the calls in both adapters, and an input rule in the Mare Mark materializer. Add a test that checks the new operation against the oracle on edge values before timing it."
msgstr "**新增运算。** 给 `Operation` 添加构造器，在 `operation_name` 中加入其名称，在 `oracle_operation3` 中加入规则，在 `working_precision` 中加入一行精度（或在 `prepare_fixture3` 中覆盖），在两个适配器中加入调用，并在 Mare Mark 实例化器中加入输入规则。在计时之前，添加一个在边界值上对照预言机检查新运算的测试。"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:234
msgid "**Figures.** The Python layouts in `tools/` read the JSONL, build Mare Mark Plot IR, and render PNG, PDF and SVG with Matplotlib:"
msgstr "**图表。** `tools/` 中的 Python 布局读取 JSONL，构建 Mare Mark Plot IR，并用 Matplotlib 渲染 PNG、PDF 和 SVG："

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:244
msgid "`tools/plot_dzmingli_supplementary_benchmark.py` draws the supplementary figure the same way."
msgstr "`tools/plot_dzmingli_supplementary_benchmark.py` 以同样方式绘制补充图。"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:247
msgid "**Sibling packages.** [`floating_vs_decmial_x`](floating_vs_decmial_x.md) applies the same method to `moonbitlang/x/decimal`. The libraries come from [floating](https://lunaflow.cn/en/floating/) and the runner from [mare_mark](https://lunaflow.cn/en/mare_mark/)."
msgstr "**兄弟包。** [`floating_vs_decmial_x`](floating_vs_decmial_x.md) 把同样的方法应用于 `moonbitlang/x/decimal`。这些库来自 [floating](https://lunaflow.cn/en/floating/)，运行器来自 [mare_mark](https://lunaflow.cn/en/mare_mark/)。"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:254
msgid "`oracle_divide` aborts on a repeating quotient such as $1/3$. Use only divisors whose reduced denominator is a product of $2$s and $5$s."
msgstr "`oracle_divide` 遇到循环小数商（例如 $1/3$）时中止。只使用约分后分母是若干 $2$ 和 $5$ 之积的除数。"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:256
msgid "`oracle_operation` passes a zero addend, so it is wrong for `Fma`; use `oracle_operation3`."
msgstr "`oracle_operation` 传入的加数为零，因此对 `Fma` 是错误的；请用 `oracle_operation3`。"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:258
msgid "The comparison ignores exponents and flags: GDA's `1.20` and DzmingLi's `1.2` agree. Use the decTest audit for representation and conditions."
msgstr "比较忽略指数和标志：GDA 的 `1.20` 与 DzmingLi 的 `1.2` 一致。表示形式和条件请用 decTest 审计检查。"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:260
msgid "`Parse` and `Format` return the prepared operand on both sides; they do not measure parsing or formatting."
msgstr "`Parse` 与 `Format` 在两边都返回预先准备好的操作数；它们并不测量解析或格式化。"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:262
msgid "`validation_count` includes failed validations; passed validations are `validation_count - failed_count`."
msgstr "`validation_count` 包含失败的校验；通过的校验数是 `validation_count - failed_count`。"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:264
msgid "`run_mare_benchmark` does not abort on validation failures; check `failed_count`. The executables do abort, after writing their report."
msgstr "`run_mare_benchmark` 不会因校验失败而中止；请检查 `failed_count`。可执行程序则会在写完报告后中止。"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:266
msgid "The executables do real work only on `--target native`; on other targets they print a message and exit."
msgstr "可执行程序只在 `--target native` 下做实际工作；在其他目标上它们打印一条消息后退出。"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:268
msgid "Do not build long test inputs with `BigInt::from_string` on `wasm-gc`: in the current `moonbitlang/core` it returns wrong values for strings of thousands of digits (4,096 nines parse to a 4,094-digit number). `parse_decimal_value` accumulates digits itself and is not affected. The package test `division precision covers exact terminating quotients` uses `from_string` but only asserts a lower bound, so it passes on every target."
msgstr "不要在 `wasm-gc` 上用 `BigInt::from_string` 构造很长的测试输入：在当前的 `moonbitlang/core` 中，它对数千位的字符串返回错误的值（4,096 个 9 被解析为一个 4,094 位的数）。`parse_decimal_value` 自己累加数字，不受影响。包内测试 `division precision covers exact terminating quotients` 使用了 `from_string`，但只断言一个下界，因此在所有目标上都能通过。"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:274
msgid "DzmingLi aborts on products above about 21,475 digits (see the [design page](../design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md#operation-specific-size-ceilings)); keep multiplication inputs at or below 10,000 digits."
msgstr "DzmingLi 在乘积超过约 21,475 位时中止（见[设计页](../design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md#operation-specific-size-ceilings)）；乘法输入请保持在 10,000 位以内。"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:280
msgid "[API reference](../api/dzmingli_vs_floating.md) for every item."
msgstr "[API 参考](../api/dzmingli_vs_floating.md)：每个条目。"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:281
msgid "[Design](../design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md) for the oracle, the precision contract and the statistics."
msgstr "[设计](../design/dzmingli_vs_floating.md)：预言机、精度约定和统计方法。"

#: manual/tutorial/dzmingli_vs_floating.md:283
msgid "[Performance analysis](../performance/dzmingli_vs_floating.md) for the measured results."
msgstr "[性能分析](../performance/dzmingli_vs_floating.md)：测量结果。"

